WEBVTT

00:43.790 --> 00:47.290
<b><i>And so the Statue of Justice,</i>
<i>a symbol of peace,</i></b>

00:47.380 --> 00:52.510
<b><i>was saved thanks to Mr. Legend!</i></b>

00:53.170 --> 00:54.840
<b>He's so cool.</b>

01:02.140 --> 01:03.600
<b>Well... I'm off to work.</b>

01:05.350 --> 01:06.310
<b>Whoops...</b>

02:55.920 --> 02:57.630
<b><i>We have breaking news!</i></b>

02:57.710 --> 03:01.800
<b><i>Robbers attacked an armored truck</i>
<i>in the West Silver, Stern Medaille area</i></b>

03:01.890 --> 03:04.470
<b><i>and made off with</i>
<i>three million Stern Dollars.</i></b>

03:08.390 --> 03:10.390
<b><i>Oh, no! The police car!</i></b>

03:11.640 --> 03:13.810
<b><i>Will they let them make off</i>
<i>with the cash?</i></b>

03:16.980 --> 03:20.070
<b><i>We still haven't spotted any heroes.</i></b>

03:20.950 --> 03:24.740
<b><i>As all of you know, we bring coverage</i>
<i>of super-powered heroes</i></b>

03:24.820 --> 03:28.120
<b><i>taking on crimes and natural disasters</i></b>

03:28.200 --> 03:30.540
<b><i>straight to your living room!</i></b>

03:31.040 --> 03:33.250
<b><i>This is HERO TV LIVE,</i></b>

03:33.330 --> 03:38.050
<b><i>the rescue entertainment program</i>
<i>that rates heroes by their actions to pick</i></b>

03:38.130 --> 03:40.470
<b><i>the King of Heroes!</i></b>

03:41.970 --> 03:43.090
<b>Whoa!</b>

03:46.220 --> 03:47.640
<b><i>And here comes one now!</i></b>

03:48.510 --> 03:51.270
<b><i>It's Fire Emblem,</i>
<i>the Bourgeois Open Flame Broil!</i></b>

03:51.850 --> 03:54.650
<b><i>Will he be able to make</i>
<i>a grand arrest today?!</i></b>

03:56.310 --> 03:57.730
<b>Get the camera closer!</b>

03:57.820 --> 03:58.980
<b>Got it!</b>

04:03.450 --> 04:06.370
<b><i>Yes! Is he going to use his Fireball?!</i></b>

04:09.580 --> 04:10.950
<b><i>A merciless attack!</i></b>

04:17.090 --> 04:18.880
<b><i>And there's another one!</i></b>

04:18.960 --> 04:21.590
<b><i>It's Rock Bison,</i>
<i>the Bull Tank of the West Coast!</i></b>

04:24.840 --> 04:27.800
<b><i>Things haven't been good</i>
<i>for Rock Bison this season!</i></b>

04:27.890 --> 04:30.430
<b><i>It looks like we'll be able to see him</i>
<i>in action for the first time in a while!</i></b>

04:35.400 --> 04:36.230
<b>Huh? What?</b>

04:39.320 --> 04:40.690
<b><i>H-Hey, stop!</i></b>

04:41.440 --> 04:44.110
<b><i>It looks like Rock Bison can't</i>
<i>pull his horns out!</i></b>

04:50.540 --> 04:52.580
<b><i>They hijacked a taxi!</i></b>

04:54.870 --> 04:56.290
<b>Oh shucks...!</b>

04:57.790 --> 04:58.710
<b>There we go...</b>

05:03.300 --> 05:04.260
<b>Huh?</b>

05:15.270 --> 05:19.150
<b><i>Wow! She charged up her arms</i>
<i>and released her special attack!</i></b>

05:19.230 --> 05:21.270
<b><i>Two suspects are under arrest!</i></b>

05:24.280 --> 05:28.700
<b><i>A triumphant moment for Dragon Kid,</i>
<i>the Lightning Bolt Kung Fu Master!</i></b>

05:30.370 --> 05:33.660
<b><i>And as usual, Origami Cyclone</i>
<i>can be seen in the background.</i></b>

05:36.870 --> 05:39.920
<b><i>This incident is now— Huh?</i></b>

05:40.000 --> 05:43.340
<b><i>Oh, no! One of the robbers is</i>
<i>still on the run!</i></b>

05:47.470 --> 05:48.680
<b>Hurry up and move out!</b>

05:48.760 --> 05:50.680
<b><i>This is terrible!</i></b>

05:50.760 --> 05:52.060
<b><i>According to the information</i>
<i>we just received,</i></b>

05:52.140 --> 05:54.890
<b><i>the robber has hijacked a monorail.</i></b>

05:55.890 --> 05:57.100
<b><i>Go slower!</i></b>

06:06.150 --> 06:07.240
<b>What should we do?</b>

06:07.990 --> 06:09.990
<b>It's best not to interfere with—</b>

06:10.070 --> 06:11.200
<b>Look! Over there!</b>

06:14.580 --> 06:15.410
<b>Wow!</b>

06:16.000 --> 06:17.580
<b><i>Are you sure he's okay?!</i></b>

06:17.660 --> 06:22.420
<b><i>Wild Tiger, the Crusher for Justice,</i>
<i>has shown up in this terrible situation.</i></b>

06:23.210 --> 06:24.420
<b>Now cut to a commercial!</b>

06:25.000 --> 06:26.170
<b>Tiger, can you hear me?</b>

06:26.800 --> 06:29.130
<b>Make your move in 30 seconds—
after the commercials are done!</b>

06:29.220 --> 06:30.640
<b>Huh? Commercials?</b>

06:36.020 --> 06:39.020
<b>I can't wait for the commercials
at a time like this!</b>

06:39.560 --> 06:41.520
<b><i>Hey! Listen to me!</i></b>

06:42.190 --> 06:43.820
<b>Things will be more exciting my way!</b>

06:43.900 --> 06:44.940
<b><i>I don't care.</i></b>

06:46.530 --> 06:50.200
<b>We heroes only care</b>

06:50.910 --> 06:52.700
<b>about keeping the peace!</b>

06:54.240 --> 06:56.200
<b>Wild Roar!</b>

06:56.700 --> 06:58.660
<b>He's doing it again...</b>

06:59.790 --> 07:01.370
<b>- Continue!
- Oh... Yes, ma'am.</b>

07:03.210 --> 07:07.130
<b><i>Wild Tiger is activating</i>
<i>his Hundred Power!</i></b>

07:07.670 --> 07:10.050
<b><i>This makes his physical abilities...</i></b>

07:10.130 --> 07:12.180
<b>- Go faster!
- I can't!</b>

07:13.180 --> 07:14.390
<b><i>...a hundred times more powerful!</i></b>

07:22.900 --> 07:24.270
<b>Give up—</b>

07:26.110 --> 07:26.940
<b>Huh?</b>

07:28.070 --> 07:29.610
<b>You idiot! He's below you!</b>

07:29.690 --> 07:31.400
<b>When did he get there?</b>

07:33.490 --> 07:35.620
<b><i>The robber has gotten on an airship!</i></b>

07:37.620 --> 07:41.080
<b><i>And here comes Sky High,</i>
<i>the Windmaster!!</i></b>

07:41.160 --> 07:46.090
<b><i>Mr. Hero, the star player this season,</i>
<i>is on the scene!</i></b>

07:47.590 --> 07:51.470
<b>That bastard...
He showed up at the best part!</b>

07:53.970 --> 07:55.140
<b>Huh?</b>

08:05.400 --> 08:07.610
<b>Don't try to resist.</b>

08:08.190 --> 08:09.780
<b>Don't try to resist!</b>

08:10.280 --> 08:12.900
<b>Don't copy me!</b>

08:24.960 --> 08:27.460
<b><i>Oh no!</i>
<i>The suspect's missile has exploded!</i></b>

08:32.170 --> 08:34.840
<b><i>He's controlling the wind</i>
<i>to save people first!</i></b>

08:34.930 --> 08:36.760
<b><i>Just what we'd expect from Sky High!</i></b>

08:37.390 --> 08:40.520
<b><i>Uh, oh! The airship is heading</i>
<i>towards a building!</i></b>

08:48.270 --> 08:51.320
<b><i>At this rate, it's going to crash</i>
<i>into that passenger ship!</i></b>

08:54.200 --> 08:55.070
<b>Oh, boy!</b>

09:04.500 --> 09:06.670
<b><i>Quit wasting your time.</i></b>

09:07.710 --> 09:11.090
<b><i>It's the moment all you fans</i>
<i>have been waiting for!</i></b>

09:11.170 --> 09:14.130
<b><i>Blue Rose, the superstar</i>
<i>of the hero world,</i></b>

09:14.220 --> 09:17.300
<b><i>has saved the passenger ship</i>
<i>with her Freezing Liquid Gun!</i></b>

09:20.180 --> 09:22.600
<b>Camera B! Get a shot from below!</b>

09:23.930 --> 09:26.390
<b><i>My ice is a little bit cold, </i></b>

09:26.480 --> 09:28.850
<b><i>but your crime has been completely</i>
<i>put on hold!</i></b>

09:28.940 --> 09:30.610
<b><i>She's done it!</i></b>

09:31.610 --> 09:33.730
<b>Do you want ratings that badly?!</b>

09:35.110 --> 09:37.530
<b>I caught the suspect here, you know!</b>

09:45.710 --> 09:46.540
<b>You...</b>

09:46.620 --> 09:48.210
<b>That's what you get for getting in my way!</b>

09:48.290 --> 09:51.210
<b>What are you doing?</b>

09:51.290 --> 09:54.210
<b><i>He's all right! Wild Tiger was shot,</i>
<i>but he's all right!</i></b>

09:57.720 --> 10:01.720
<b>Hey! Stay away from me!
I can't take this anymore!</b>

10:01.800 --> 10:04.680
<b><i>It's her explosive Cutie Escape!</i></b>

10:07.100 --> 10:08.690
<b>She's just running away.</b>

10:08.770 --> 10:09.600
<b>Hey, watch it!</b>

10:11.360 --> 10:12.690
<b><i>What an amazing jump!</i></b>

10:12.770 --> 10:14.440
<b>Bastard!</b>

10:19.030 --> 10:20.450
<b><i>He's out of time!</i></b>

10:20.530 --> 10:23.450
<b><i>Wild Tiger's power only lasts</i>
<i>for five minutes!</i></b>

10:23.530 --> 10:24.660
<b>Oh no!</b>

10:25.240 --> 10:27.410
<b><i>Tiger has become</i>
<i>an ordinary human again!</i></b>

10:27.500 --> 10:30.080
<b><i>He's in danger now!</i></b>

10:46.180 --> 10:47.020
<b>Huh?</b>

10:48.980 --> 10:50.390
<b>Who are you?</b>

10:50.980 --> 10:52.400
<b>Don't push yourself.</b>

10:55.320 --> 10:57.030
<b><i>It's...! Uh, who is he?</i></b>

11:03.740 --> 11:06.490
<b><i>The mystery man has</i>
<i>arrested the criminal!</i></b>

11:13.420 --> 11:16.000
<b><i>Is this the birth of a new star?!</i></b>

11:16.590 --> 11:19.470
<b><i>This season has ended</i>
<i>with a mysterious hero!</i></b>

11:20.510 --> 11:21.430
<b>Awesome!</b>

11:29.890 --> 11:31.270
<b>Cut to a commercial!</b>

11:36.570 --> 11:40.280
<b>Hurry... I have to see you now...</b>

11:44.370 --> 11:46.780
<b>This is what I'm talking about!</b>

11:46.870 --> 11:48.290
<b>NEX! NEX!</b>

11:49.750 --> 11:52.790
<b>Your NEX is refreshingly cold...</b>

11:52.870 --> 11:56.290
<b>It puts my heart completely on hold!</b>

11:57.630 --> 11:59.340
<b>The great taste that draws you in...</b>

12:01.130 --> 12:02.380
<b>Pepsi!</b>

12:02.880 --> 12:03.880
<b>- NEX!
- NEX!</b>

12:13.390 --> 12:17.020
<b>Rose! Rose! Rose!</b>

12:25.530 --> 12:28.410
<b>Hey, who's your sponsor?</b>

12:28.490 --> 12:29.580
<b>Sponsor?</b>

12:29.660 --> 12:32.000
<b>You're a free agent, yet you decided
to stick your neck into this?</b>

12:32.080 --> 12:33.250
<b>What were you thinking?</b>

12:34.710 --> 12:36.750
<b>Does it matter? I made the arrest.</b>

12:37.330 --> 12:42.170
<b>Anyway, a hero shouldn't remove
his mask in front of other people.</b>

12:42.260 --> 12:43.260
<b>It's unheard of!</b>

12:44.180 --> 12:48.430
<b>Heroes never reveal their identities.</b>

12:48.510 --> 12:49.600
<b>How old-fashioned.</b>

12:50.510 --> 12:53.520
<b>You've fallen behind the times, old man.</b>

12:53.600 --> 12:54.440
<b>What?</b>

13:04.320 --> 13:07.450
<b><i>Everyone, thank you for waiting.</i></b>

13:08.030 --> 13:12.120
<b>We're about to announce
the results of this season's HERO TV.</b>

13:19.040 --> 13:21.000
<b>Do you realize what
you've done, Kotetsu?</b>

13:21.550 --> 13:24.010
<b>Why did you have to bend the rail?</b>

13:24.090 --> 13:26.630
<b>And you didn't have to
break the car windows, did you?</b>

13:26.720 --> 13:27.550
<b>Well...</b>

13:27.640 --> 13:30.640
<b>Then why did you break them?
Do you know how much that costs?</b>

13:30.720 --> 13:32.390
<b>Sorry for always causing you trouble.</b>

13:32.970 --> 13:35.810
<b>You do know who
made you a hero, don't you?</b>

13:37.520 --> 13:38.810
<b>Our sponsors, sir!</b>

13:39.400 --> 13:42.610
<b>Good. Now get to the award ceremony!</b>

13:42.690 --> 13:43.730
<b>Okay!</b>

13:44.900 --> 13:48.820
<b><i>Fire Emblem! Rock Bison!</i>
<i>Dragon Kid!</i></b>

13:48.910 --> 13:54.830
<b><i>Origami Cyclone! Sky High!</i>
<i>Blue Rose! Wild Tiger!</i></b>

13:55.410 --> 13:57.330
<b><i>Who's going to shine as the victor?</i></b>

13:57.920 --> 13:58.830
<b>You're late.</b>

13:58.920 --> 14:00.630
<b>When's the MVP announcement?</b>

14:00.710 --> 14:01.630
<b>Right now.</b>

14:01.710 --> 14:02.750
<b>Made it in time.</b>

14:02.840 --> 14:04.380
<b>It's definitely not you.</b>

14:04.460 --> 14:05.420
<b>Shut up!</b>

14:06.920 --> 14:10.640
<b><i>Thank you for waiting!</i>
<i>We are going to announce our MVP!</i></b>

14:21.020 --> 14:25.690
<b><i>With 12,730 points,</i>
<i>the King of Heroes is...</i></b>

14:25.780 --> 14:27.280
<b><i>Sky High!</i></b>

14:28.820 --> 14:30.490
<b><i>Congratulations.</i></b>

14:30.990 --> 14:32.990
<b>I couldn't have done it
without all of your support.</b>

14:33.490 --> 14:36.250
<b>Thanks, and thanks again!</b>

14:44.040 --> 14:46.960
<b>Next up,
a message from Albert Maverick,</b>

14:47.050 --> 14:51.970
<b><i>the CEO of Apollon Media</i>
<i>and president of OBC!</i></b>

14:54.100 --> 14:57.640
<b><i>But before that, there's someone</i>
<i>I want to introduce to everyone.</i></b>

14:57.730 --> 14:59.140
<b>Come on in.</b>

15:02.310 --> 15:07.030
<b>This is Barnaby Brooks Jr.</b>

15:07.530 --> 15:09.780
<b>He has just been officially approved
by the Justice Bureau.</b>

15:10.400 --> 15:14.370
<b><i>He is the new hero who will be</i>
<i>keeping the peace in Stern Bild.</i></b>

15:16.240 --> 15:17.160
<b>Heh...</b>

15:18.000 --> 15:19.750
<b>"Heh," my ass!</b>

15:19.830 --> 15:20.750
<b>Now, now...</b>

15:20.830 --> 15:23.880
<b>When he activates his power,</b>

15:23.960 --> 15:28.300
<b>his physical abilities become
a hundred times more powerful.</b>

15:28.380 --> 15:29.340
<b>Huh?</b>

15:29.420 --> 15:31.720
<b>It only lasts for five minutes,</b>

15:31.800 --> 15:35.010
<b>and there's another hero with
the same power,</b>

15:35.510 --> 15:38.060
<b>but he's still young!</b>

15:38.140 --> 15:43.520
<b>Try not to become a hero
who needs rescuing.</b>

15:47.150 --> 15:50.530
<b><i>It's been 45 years since</i>
<i>people with special powers,</i></b>

15:50.610 --> 15:54.110
<b><i>known as NEXT, appeared in this world</i>
<i>due to a mutation.</i></b>

15:54.200 --> 15:55.120
<b><i>We still don't know...</i></b>

15:55.200 --> 15:57.620
<b>- I'm going home.
- <i>what trigger these powers.</i></b>

17:11.980 --> 17:15.530
<b><i>No matter what happens,</i>
<i>please be a hero.</i></b>

17:16.660 --> 17:17.700
<b><i>Promise me that.</i></b>

17:33.880 --> 17:37.680
<b>I managed to get through
this season safely...</b>

17:39.390 --> 17:40.390
<b>Tomoe...</b>

18:11.040 --> 18:12.290
<b>Welcome.</b>

18:14.840 --> 18:17.970
<b>"A veteran hero who
made his debut ten years ago."</b>

18:18.050 --> 18:21.010
<b>"He may be past his prime..."</b>

18:26.600 --> 18:28.730
<b>I'd like ten of these, ma'am!</b>

18:28.810 --> 18:29.940
<b>Okay.</b>

18:34.980 --> 18:36.400
<b>What's up?</b>

18:37.990 --> 18:40.160
<b>Hey, aren't you going
to come to the party?</b>

18:40.240 --> 18:41.870
<b><i>I don't really care for those things.</i></b>

18:41.950 --> 18:44.990
<b>You should greet the bigwigs.</b>

18:45.080 --> 18:46.950
<b><i>Well, you take care of that for me.</i></b>

18:47.700 --> 18:48.910
<b><i>Oh, hey...</i></b>

18:51.630 --> 18:53.920
<b>Your butt always feels so nice.</b>

18:54.750 --> 18:56.670
<b>Knock it off! Get away from me!</b>

18:57.340 --> 18:59.380
<b>The way you showed up
in the background was splendid.</b>

18:59.470 --> 19:01.050
<b>I want you to keep doing it.</b>

19:01.140 --> 19:05.930
<b>I'll try my best to bring the spotlight
on the company name. I mean, I will.</b>

19:06.010 --> 19:10.810
<b>Sir, my catch phrase is embarrassing.
Can't I change it?</b>

19:10.890 --> 19:13.730
<b>That domineering attitude is
what makes you so popular.</b>

19:14.270 --> 19:15.520
<b>You just don't get it, do you?</b>

19:15.610 --> 19:16.980
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

19:19.610 --> 19:22.530
<b>Thanks, and thanks again!</b>

19:23.120 --> 19:24.030
<b>Mr. Maverick!</b>

19:24.910 --> 19:29.540
<b>It was the right choice to make you
the producer of this show.</b>

19:29.620 --> 19:32.250
<b>I never expected you
to pull in these ratings.</b>

19:32.330 --> 19:35.130
<b>I, Agnes Joubert, intend
to make the show...</b>

19:36.000 --> 19:37.960
<b>much more intense!</b>

19:52.600 --> 19:53.810
<b>Mr. Barnaby.</b>

19:54.860 --> 19:58.030
<b>My name is Yuri Petrov.</b>

19:58.530 --> 20:00.280
<b>I've been assigned to the Justice Bureau
as of today.</b>

20:01.070 --> 20:03.160
<b>Pleased to meet you.</b>

20:03.240 --> 20:06.030
<b>I look forward to your work.</b>

20:06.620 --> 20:08.540
<b>I'll try my best to meet
your expectations.</b>

20:09.200 --> 20:12.540
<b>Make sure to follow
your own code of justice.</b>

20:14.210 --> 20:15.170
<b>I will.</b>

20:23.130 --> 20:24.550
<b>Coming, coming, coming...</b>

20:26.600 --> 20:27.430
<b>Hello?</b>

20:27.510 --> 20:28.350
<b><i>Dad?</i></b>

20:28.430 --> 20:31.100
<b>Hey! How's it goin', Kaede?</b>

20:31.680 --> 20:34.980
<b>You haven't forgotten about
my recital tomorrow, have you?</b>

20:35.060 --> 20:37.940
<b>Of course not!
I promised that I'd be there.</b>

20:38.480 --> 20:39.820
<b>Really?</b>

20:40.440 --> 20:42.530
<b>You don't have to work?</b>

20:42.610 --> 20:43.650
<b><i>Don't worry!</i></b>

20:43.740 --> 20:49.330
<b>Tomorrow, I'm going to get
a good look at how cute you are!</b>

20:49.410 --> 20:51.160
<b>I wouldn't miss it!</b>

20:51.250 --> 20:52.620
<b><i>Is that so?</i></b>

20:54.120 --> 20:56.920
<b>You should have told me
that you took the phone, Mom.</b>

20:57.000 --> 21:00.050
<b>I saw you on TV. Are you going to
have to pay for damages again?</b>

21:01.340 --> 21:05.180
<b>You always become reckless
when you get worked up. Be careful.</b>

21:05.760 --> 21:07.010
<b>I know.</b>

21:07.090 --> 21:12.100
<b><i>Anyway, if you die,</i>
<i>I'm going to have to tell Kaede</i></b>

21:12.180 --> 21:14.270
<b><i>that her father was a hero.</i></b>

21:14.350 --> 21:16.690
<b><i>I want you to really be careful.</i></b>

21:47.590 --> 21:49.090
<b>Ouroboros...</b>

21:57.350 --> 21:58.900
<b>Sorry, Kotetsu.</b>

22:00.060 --> 22:01.270
<b>Ben...</b>

22:01.860 --> 22:02.770
<b>A merger?</b>

22:02.860 --> 22:04.690
<b>Major money was involved.</b>

22:04.780 --> 22:10.070
<b>We were struggling with funds,
so we found a good buyer. Here.</b>

22:10.570 --> 22:12.830
<b>Huh? Who is this guy?</b>

22:13.330 --> 22:14.950
<b>Your new boss.</b>

22:16.200 --> 22:18.290
<b>Go say hello right now.</b>

22:18.370 --> 22:21.540
<b>Wait a second.
I don't understand what's going on.</b>

22:22.130 --> 22:26.550
<b>Starting next season, only the seven major
companies are going to have heroes.</b>

22:27.630 --> 22:30.390
<b>And our company was the last one to go.</b>

22:30.470 --> 22:32.550
<b>In other words, we're going to disappear?</b>

22:33.140 --> 22:35.180
<b>You don't need to know about it.</b>

22:35.270 --> 22:37.480
<b>Did the other heroes know about this?</b>

22:39.810 --> 22:41.060
<b>Was I the only one who didn't know?</b>

22:41.940 --> 22:43.070
<b>Sorry.</b>

22:47.860 --> 22:49.530
<b>Are you Wild Tiger?</b>

22:50.450 --> 22:53.370
<b>You got "Tiger" from
your name Toratetsu, huh?</b>

22:53.450 --> 22:56.240
<b>It's Kotetsu. Kotetsu Kaburagi.</b>

22:56.330 --> 22:57.620
<b>Hmm...</b>

22:59.540 --> 23:02.920
<b>I want you to go down to the Development
Department to get a briefing on your suit.</b>

23:03.000 --> 23:05.920
<b>Oh... I hadn't heard that
I was starting today.</b>

23:06.510 --> 23:08.420
<b>You can quit if you don't like it.</b>

23:13.510 --> 23:14.430
<b>I'll do it.</b>

23:17.470 --> 23:18.850
<b>The industrial area?</b>

23:20.730 --> 23:22.100
<b>The Steel Hammer Statue?!</b>

23:22.730 --> 23:25.360
<b>It's supposed to only be
a symbolic art piece.</b>

23:25.860 --> 23:27.820
<b>Why is it moving?</b>

23:27.900 --> 23:29.570
<b>This might be the work of a NEXT.</b>

23:29.650 --> 23:31.410
<b>Okay, get moving right away.</b>

23:31.490 --> 23:32.320
<b>Huh?</b>

23:33.160 --> 23:36.200
<b>I want you to make use of your new suit.</b>

23:37.540 --> 23:39.290
<b>I can't do that...sir.</b>

23:40.120 --> 23:41.830
<b>Do you have a problem with it?</b>

23:42.580 --> 23:45.670
<b>I have no intention of wearing any suit
other than my own.</b>

23:45.750 --> 23:50.170
<b>Don't worry. The specs on this one are
far better than the one you wore.</b>

23:50.260 --> 23:51.930
<b>That's not the issue here!</b>

23:52.590 --> 23:56.560
<b>I need to wear that suit to be a hero!</b>

23:56.640 --> 23:58.970
<b>It's what I aspire to become...</b>

23:59.060 --> 24:00.890
<b>Just get going already!</b>

24:00.980 --> 24:01.850
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

24:18.830 --> 24:20.660
<b>Actually, this is pretty nice.</b>

24:23.170 --> 24:25.460
<b>That's him! All right...</b>

24:25.540 --> 24:27.130
<b><i>There's one important thing.</i></b>

24:27.210 --> 24:29.710
<b>I'm going to pair you up
with another hero.</b>

24:29.800 --> 24:30.630
<b>Huh?</b>

24:31.340 --> 24:33.380
<b>The first team in the hero world.</b>

24:33.470 --> 24:35.470
<b>That's what Apollon Media
wants to sell.</b>

24:35.550 --> 24:37.470
<b>I hadn't heard about that.</b>

24:37.550 --> 24:39.970
<b>You can quit if you don't like it.</b>

24:43.480 --> 24:46.900
<b>What's this about a team?
Who am I pairing up with?</b>

24:50.110 --> 24:53.070
<b>That hurt... I guess I can't
do this on my own.</b>

24:53.700 --> 24:55.280
<b>Huh? You?!</b>

24:58.240 --> 25:00.120
<b>What? Really?
With you, Rock Bison?</b>

25:01.290 --> 25:02.120
<b>Huh?</b>

25:02.700 --> 25:05.790
<b>What do you mean, "huh"?
You're my—</b>

25:11.920 --> 25:13.380
<b>Let's go, old man.</b>

25:15.800 --> 25:17.220
<b>You?!</b>

25:19.140 --> 25:20.720
<b>Chaser Change!</b>

25:24.560 --> 25:25.600
<b>Double Chaser!</b>

25:29.190 --> 25:30.690
<b>Why am I on this side?!</b>

25:31.480 --> 25:32.730
<b>It suits you well.</b>

25:33.360 --> 25:35.030
<b>That doesn't answer my question!</b>

25:35.110 --> 25:36.660
<b>It's company orders.</b>

26:00.350 --> 26:02.600
<b><i>Leave this area to me.</i>
<i>The rest of you will—</i></b>

26:09.730 --> 26:11.520
<b>Why aren't we going in?</b>

26:12.110 --> 26:13.230
<b>I'm collecting data.</b>

26:14.900 --> 26:17.320
<b>If we know what the other heroes
are doing,</b>

26:17.400 --> 26:20.240
<b>we can avoid showing up at the same time
and stand out in the show.</b>

26:20.320 --> 26:21.990
<b>Hah! That's just stupid!</b>

26:25.000 --> 26:26.830
<b>Will standing out help us to
catch the criminal?</b>

26:26.910 --> 26:29.000
<b>Will it bring peace to the city? Will it?</b>

26:29.580 --> 26:30.710
<b>Listen, a hero is all about—</b>

26:30.790 --> 26:32.670
<b><i>Bonjour, heroes.</i></b>

26:33.250 --> 26:35.170
<b>Time to start the show. Good luck!</b>

26:35.920 --> 26:37.670
<b>Three, two...</b>

26:38.760 --> 26:42.760
<b><i>Welcome to HERO TV LIVE!</i></b>

26:44.010 --> 26:47.640
<b><i>Stern Bild's seven major companies now</i>
<i>have exclusive rights over the heroes!</i></b>

26:48.310 --> 26:52.520
<b><i>We're starting fresh under</i>
<i>a new management system!</i></b>

26:53.020 --> 26:58.110
<b><i>Which hero will win the honor</i>
<i>of becoming King this season?</i></b>

27:01.740 --> 27:03.160
<b>Come on, it's time for work.</b>

27:03.240 --> 27:06.080
<b>Wait! I'm still not done talking to you.</b>

27:07.290 --> 27:08.370
<b>Excuse me!</b>

27:09.910 --> 27:11.120
<b>What the heck?</b>

27:11.710 --> 27:14.670
<b><i>Is that truck what I think it is?!</i></b>

27:18.050 --> 27:20.970
<b><i>My ice is a little bit cold,</i></b>

27:21.050 --> 27:23.850
<b><i>but your crime has been</i>
<i>completely put on hold!</i></b>

27:23.930 --> 27:27.930
<b><i>There she is! It's not just</i>
<i>her body that's naughty!</i></b>

27:28.020 --> 27:30.600
<b><i>Blue Rose is on the scene!</i></b>

27:31.270 --> 27:33.900
<b>All right! I made it into
the background!</b>

27:33.980 --> 27:36.150
<b>Give me a break, you guys...</b>

27:38.650 --> 27:40.780
<b>Hey, wait up!</b>

27:45.120 --> 27:46.990
<b>I'll bring that thing down using my wires!</b>

27:47.080 --> 27:48.080
<b>Yeah, good luck with that.</b>

27:48.160 --> 27:51.670
<b>Shut up! I'll show you
what being a hero is all about!</b>

27:54.880 --> 27:55.710
<b>Huh?</b>

27:57.000 --> 27:57.840
<b>Huh?</b>

28:03.550 --> 28:04.680
<b>Now watch and learn!</b>

28:10.230 --> 28:11.850
<b><i>Is that...?</i></b>

28:12.350 --> 28:17.270
<b><i>Yes, there he is!</i>
<i>It's Barnaby, the new hero!</i></b>

28:17.940 --> 28:18.780
<b><i>Heh.</i></b>

28:19.360 --> 28:20.900
<b>"Heh," my ass!</b>

28:21.570 --> 28:22.570
<b>All right!</b>

28:32.660 --> 28:33.500
<b>Yes!</b>

28:35.080 --> 28:36.750
<b>Huh? Wha—</b>

28:41.420 --> 28:42.300
<b>Huh?!</b>

28:47.800 --> 28:49.220
<b>What kind of joke is this?</b>

28:49.810 --> 28:51.600
<b>You got yourself caught in it!</b>

29:02.940 --> 29:05.240
<b>I can't work with that guy!</b>

29:05.860 --> 29:09.030
<b>Say that after you get some results.</b>

29:09.120 --> 29:12.540
<b>I thought you two were goners.</b>

29:13.580 --> 29:16.210
<b>Lucky for you that thing stopped.</b>

29:16.790 --> 29:19.420
<b><i>An hour has passed since</i>
<i>the stone statue stopped its advance.</i></b>

29:19.500 --> 29:21.840
<b><i>And it still doesn't look like</i>
<i>it's going to be moving.</i></b>

29:22.380 --> 29:25.590
<b>What do you suppose
the culprit is trying to do?</b>

29:25.680 --> 29:27.680
<b>That doesn't matter.</b>

29:28.890 --> 29:31.350
<b>I'm more concerned about you
than what's going on right now!</b>

29:31.430 --> 29:32.850
<b>Do you understand
the situation you're in?</b>

29:32.930 --> 29:33.770
<b>My situation?</b>

29:33.850 --> 29:38.560
<b>That's right. We have a contract
with you to act as Barnaby's foil.</b>

29:38.650 --> 29:39.900
<b>What?</b>

29:39.980 --> 29:42.650
<b>You're Barnaby's second, his assistant,
an add-on.</b>

29:42.730 --> 29:43.570
<b>Understand?</b>

29:43.650 --> 29:46.820
<b>Hey, wait a minute!
Why do I have to be his assistant?!</b>

29:46.910 --> 29:50.580
<b>And by the way, our mechanic is angry
with you too.</b>

29:58.420 --> 29:59.420
<b>Hm?</b>

30:02.840 --> 30:03.840
<b>Excuse me?</b>

30:07.430 --> 30:09.340
<b>Hm? Huh? What?</b>

30:09.800 --> 30:12.890
<b>I'm Saito. I developed your suit.</b>

30:12.970 --> 30:14.100
<b>I can barely hear you.</b>

30:14.600 --> 30:17.310
<b>You need to make better use of the suit.</b>

30:17.520 --> 30:20.060
<b>Well, I'm still not familiar with it yet.</b>

30:20.150 --> 30:24.690
<b>Take a look.
This is the suit I designed.</b>

30:25.570 --> 30:28.360
<b>And this it the crappy suit
you used to wear.</b>

30:29.110 --> 30:31.410
<b>It's not that bad...</b>

30:31.490 --> 30:32.660
<b>Let's see about that.</b>

31:02.770 --> 31:05.780
<b>I get it! I get it already!</b>

31:08.900 --> 31:10.780
<b>You showed me enough, okay?</b>

31:13.780 --> 31:15.700
<b>Yeah, and that expression of yours too.</b>

31:15.790 --> 31:19.500
<b>Also, since your ability only lasts
for five minutes,</b>

31:19.580 --> 31:21.540
<b>I've added a special feature
which takes that into consideration.</b>

31:21.960 --> 31:22.790
<b>Huh?</b>

31:22.880 --> 31:24.250
<b>See the button on the left arm?</b>

31:29.760 --> 31:30.760
<b>You mean this?</b>

31:30.840 --> 31:32.180
<b>I'm not done explaining!</b>

31:39.430 --> 31:42.440
<b><i>The time is 3:28 P.M.</i></b>

31:42.940 --> 31:45.820
<b>It's a clock. See?</b>

31:51.360 --> 31:52.780
<b>Was he that surprised?</b>

31:53.030 --> 31:56.330
<b>I'm really sorry! I was planning
to get there by three.</b>

31:56.410 --> 31:58.290
<b><i>So where are you right now?</i></b>

31:58.370 --> 32:00.160
<b>I still have some work left.</b>

32:00.870 --> 32:02.170
<b>Are you really going to come?</b>

32:02.250 --> 32:03.370
<b><i>Of course.</i></b>

32:03.920 --> 32:06.170
<b>When? How long until you get there?</b>

32:06.250 --> 32:08.090
<b><i>Uh, well...</i></b>

32:10.300 --> 32:11.670
<b>You're not coming, are you?</b>

32:11.760 --> 32:14.050
<b><i>I'll be there!</i>
<i>When does it start again?</i></b>

32:14.140 --> 32:14.970
<b>At four.</b>

32:15.550 --> 32:16.680
<b>Okay! I'm leaving right now.</b>

32:18.560 --> 32:20.140
<b>Hold on a second.</b>

32:20.220 --> 32:23.060
<b><i>Tiger and Barnaby,</i>
<i>we need you to jump into action!</i></b>

32:23.140 --> 32:25.060
<b><i>The stone statue has</i>
<i>begun to move.</i></b>

32:25.150 --> 32:27.820
<b><i>Get ready stat and head to the scene.</i></b>

32:28.400 --> 32:29.230
<b>Uh, listen...</b>

32:29.320 --> 32:32.070
<b><i>Oh no... I'm starting to get nervous!</i></b>

32:32.610 --> 32:34.610
<b>Dad, hurry up and get here!</b>

32:35.280 --> 32:37.160
<b>I mean it. You have to come!</b>

32:43.710 --> 32:45.120
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

32:45.880 --> 32:49.880
<b>I'll never forget that
you wasted three minutes of my life.</b>

32:51.010 --> 32:53.380
<b>You don't have friends, do you?</b>

32:53.970 --> 32:58.890
<b><i>How will the heroes deal with this</i>
<i>strange giant visitor from the Brox area?</i></b>

33:03.140 --> 33:05.650
<b><i>Blue Roes is the first one</i>
<i>to arrive on the scene!</i></b>

33:07.650 --> 33:09.650
<b>Hold it right there!</b>

33:10.230 --> 33:11.650
<b><i>And there she goes!</i></b>

33:11.730 --> 33:14.360
<b>My ice is a little bit cold...</b>

33:35.050 --> 33:37.970
<b>...but your movements
have been completely—</b>

33:51.360 --> 33:53.400
<b><i>Looks like her ice wasn't</i>
<i>enough to stop it!</i></b>

33:53.480 --> 33:54.990
<b>You're kidding, right?!</b>

34:04.000 --> 34:06.540
<b><i>It walked right over</i>
<i>her Cutie Escape!</i></b>

34:10.130 --> 34:12.130
<b>Cold, cold, cold...</b>

34:12.920 --> 34:15.130
<b>If you're going to create such a mess,</b>

34:15.210 --> 34:17.220
<b>the least you could have done
was stop that thing!</b>

34:18.090 --> 34:19.590
<b>Shut up...</b>

34:26.810 --> 34:31.190
<b><i>It looks like the heroes are tied up</i>
<i>with saving the civilians first.</i></b>

34:34.440 --> 34:36.860
<b>There he is!</b>

34:37.450 --> 34:39.110
<b>Hurry... Hurry up.</b>

34:39.200 --> 34:40.490
<b>We're ready.</b>

34:42.330 --> 34:46.410
<b><i>Firing in three, two, one...</i></b>

34:48.620 --> 34:50.880
<b><i>Rock Bison is in the air!</i></b>

34:51.380 --> 34:53.880
<b>Yes!</b>

34:54.460 --> 34:56.630
<b><i>He's controlling his direction</i>
<i>using his shoulder drills!</i></b>

34:56.710 --> 35:00.130
<b><i>This looks promising. Or maybe not.</i></b>

35:03.760 --> 35:04.890
<b>High!</b>

35:07.560 --> 35:10.560
<b>That was a close call...
And a close shave!</b>

35:10.650 --> 35:12.400
<b>Thanks...</b>

35:12.480 --> 35:14.820
<b>No!</b>

35:20.240 --> 35:21.530
<b>Look out!</b>

35:22.910 --> 35:24.530
<b>Huh? Huh? Huh?</b>

35:38.050 --> 35:39.420
<b>A child?</b>

35:42.550 --> 35:43.640
<b>Wait just a second.</b>

35:45.720 --> 35:46.760
<b>What are you doing?</b>

35:46.850 --> 35:48.640
<b>I'm going to save him, of course!</b>

35:48.720 --> 35:50.310
<b>If my deduction is correct...</b>

35:50.390 --> 35:52.190
<b>I don't have time to listen to that!</b>

35:52.270 --> 35:53.690
<b>Since no one is around,</b>

35:54.190 --> 35:55.900
<b>he might be the one
moving the statue.</b>

35:55.980 --> 35:56.860
<b>Out of the way!</b>

35:56.940 --> 35:59.650
<b>He's probably a NEXT who
can control the things he touches.</b>

35:59.740 --> 36:00.780
<b>Just move!</b>

36:01.360 --> 36:02.780
<b>That child might be the culprit.</b>

36:02.860 --> 36:05.070
<b>Even if he is, he's in danger!</b>

36:06.910 --> 36:10.080
<b>Your lapse in judgment almost
got us killed the last time.</b>

36:10.160 --> 36:11.960
<b>Well, that was...</b>

36:12.040 --> 36:14.710
<b>I don't trust you.</b>

36:15.790 --> 36:18.670
<b>I actually didn't want to
team up with you.</b>

36:19.460 --> 36:21.300
<b>But the company ordered me to do it.</b>

36:21.380 --> 36:23.380
<b>Oh, is that so?</b>

36:33.900 --> 36:35.230
<b>Nobody moves!</b>

36:40.990 --> 36:42.610
<b>It's Mr. Legend...</b>

36:47.120 --> 36:48.990
<b>Do you care what happens
to this kid?</b>

36:56.920 --> 36:58.040
<b>You're a...</b>

37:01.460 --> 37:04.220
<b>Your power is meant to save people.</b>

37:06.300 --> 37:10.390
<b>You saved me.
That makes you a hero too!</b>

37:24.360 --> 37:25.280
<b>Huh?</b>

37:28.450 --> 37:29.830
<b>I see you're awake now.</b>

37:30.330 --> 37:32.540
<b>Don't try to show off at a time like this.</b>

37:32.620 --> 37:35.210
<b>The stone statue stopped moving again.</b>

37:35.290 --> 37:37.250
<b>Then go ahead and free yourself!</b>

37:37.830 --> 37:38.880
<b>I can't.</b>

37:39.750 --> 37:41.460
<b>Unless I use my power, that is.</b>

37:41.550 --> 37:43.970
<b>Then use it already!</b>

37:44.050 --> 37:47.840
<b>Our power only lasts for five minutes.
I don't really want to use it here.</b>

37:47.930 --> 37:52.060
<b>Jeez. Then Lil' Bunny can stay here
and do as he pleases!</b>

37:52.930 --> 37:54.270
<b>Wait just a second!</b>

37:55.270 --> 37:58.730
<b>I might have misheard you,
but did you just call me "Lil' Bunny"?</b>

37:59.230 --> 38:04.280
<b>Yeah, because you hop about and have
long ears just like a cute bunny rabbit.</b>

38:04.360 --> 38:07.070
<b>My name's not "Bunny"!
It's "Barnaby"!</b>

38:07.660 --> 38:09.870
<b>"My name's not 'Bunny'!
It's 'Barnaby'!"</b>

38:09.950 --> 38:11.530
<b>I didn't say it like that.</b>

38:11.620 --> 38:13.080
<b>"I didn't say it like that."</b>

38:13.160 --> 38:14.250
<b><i>Bonjour!</i></b>

38:14.830 --> 38:16.750
<b><i>A different stone statue is</i>
<i>now on the move!</i></b>

38:18.250 --> 38:20.170
<b><i>The lion statue that is the symbol of</i>
<i>Helperidese Finance</i></b>

38:20.250 --> 38:23.670
<b><i>is running towards</i>
<i>the New Morghen Area.</i></b>

38:32.760 --> 38:34.680
<b>Care to free me as well?</b>

38:34.770 --> 38:35.600
<b>Huh?</b>

38:36.180 --> 38:39.350
<b>If we activate our powers at the same
time, we won't be able to stand out.</b>

38:40.600 --> 38:41.690
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

38:58.290 --> 38:59.120
<b>You there!</b>

39:01.250 --> 39:02.170
<b>Get down from there.</b>

39:03.130 --> 39:04.050
<b>Stay away!</b>

39:08.840 --> 39:10.090
<b>Hey!</b>

39:21.650 --> 39:25.730
<b>Hey, Handsome!
What are you doing up there?</b>

39:25.820 --> 39:28.280
<b>Sorry, but could you
help me with this?</b>

39:29.900 --> 39:33.820
<b>I guess I have no choice.
I can't turn down a hottie like you.</b>

39:46.630 --> 39:47.760
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

39:48.260 --> 39:50.840
<b>Hey... Come on!</b>

39:50.930 --> 39:54.550
<b>At least let me touch your butt!
Where are his manners?!</b>

39:54.640 --> 39:56.680
<b>Hm? No!</b>

40:01.480 --> 40:04.900
<b>Oh dear. I can't get out! Darn!</b>

40:08.650 --> 40:09.650
<b>- What?!
- Huh?!</b>

40:16.330 --> 40:17.740
<b>Hey! Settle down!</b>

40:26.000 --> 40:29.260
<b>Kaede! Kaede! Kaede!</b>

40:31.920 --> 40:32.760
<b>Mom?!</b>

40:33.340 --> 40:34.430
<b>Kotetsu?</b>

40:35.850 --> 40:37.720
<b>Kaede... I can't find Kaede!</b>

40:38.560 --> 40:40.930
<b>She hasn't made it out yet!</b>

40:42.310 --> 40:45.650
<b>Okay! I'll handle the rest!
You get outside!</b>

40:56.700 --> 40:57.700
<b>Hurry!</b>

41:36.780 --> 41:37.660
<b>Kaede...</b>

41:42.540 --> 41:44.330
<b>Thank you, mister.</b>

41:48.710 --> 41:50.170
<b>Now run away quickly.</b>

41:50.670 --> 41:51.500
<b>Thank you!</b>

41:57.180 --> 41:58.340
<b>Thanks.</b>

41:58.430 --> 42:03.020
<b>Huh? I don't see a reason
why you would be thanking me.</b>

42:03.100 --> 42:04.140
<b>You're right.</b>

42:04.640 --> 42:07.600
<b>Help! Help me!</b>

42:11.690 --> 42:12.570
<b>That was close.</b>

42:13.400 --> 42:14.650
<b>Don't get in my way.</b>

42:14.740 --> 42:16.700
<b>Why are you doing this?</b>

42:16.780 --> 42:19.030
<b>Because they shunned me.</b>

42:19.110 --> 42:19.950
<b>Shunned you?</b>

42:20.530 --> 42:24.200
<b>That's right. They call me creepy
and ignore me!</b>

42:24.910 --> 42:28.120
<b>That's because he started moving dolls...</b>

42:30.170 --> 42:31.630
<b>You call yourselves a NEXT,</b>

42:31.710 --> 42:33.630
<b>but that just means
you're not human, right?</b>

42:33.710 --> 42:35.460
<b>Of course,
we're creeped out by you!</b>

42:36.050 --> 42:38.470
<b>I didn't ask to have this power!</b>

42:43.850 --> 42:45.520
<b>I understand how you feel.</b>

42:45.600 --> 42:46.430
<b>You're lying!</b>

42:46.520 --> 42:47.890
<b>No, I'm not.</b>

42:48.600 --> 42:52.190
<b>I became a NEXT
when I was about your age.</b>

42:52.270 --> 42:53.110
<b>Huh?</b>

42:55.530 --> 42:59.070
<b>Similarly, my friends were
creeped out by me.</b>

42:59.570 --> 43:03.200
<b>I used to hate my powers
and cried every day.</b>

43:04.160 --> 43:08.710
<b>But one day, a hero known as Legend
taught me something.</b>

43:09.670 --> 43:12.040
<b>He said that my power
was meant to save people.</b>

43:13.920 --> 43:15.420
<b>Well, not for me.</b>

43:15.500 --> 43:16.840
<b>Why?</b>

43:16.920 --> 43:20.680
<b>Because my power isn't cool
like real heroes.</b>

43:20.760 --> 43:25.060
<b>Don't worry. There will come a time
when your powers will be useful.</b>

43:25.640 --> 43:26.850
<b>Really?</b>

43:26.930 --> 43:28.350
<b>I promise you that!</b>

43:28.430 --> 43:29.440
<b>Do you mean it?</b>

43:29.520 --> 43:32.270
<b>Yeah. That's why you have to first
apologize to everyone</b>

43:32.350 --> 43:33.560
<b>and go to the police.</b>

43:33.650 --> 43:34.980
<b>Are you crazy?!</b>

43:35.480 --> 43:37.110
<b>If we don't arrest him,
we won't get points!</b>

43:37.190 --> 43:38.610
<b>Shut up!</b>

43:39.950 --> 43:42.870
<b>You want to start using
your powers for good, right?</b>

43:42.950 --> 43:45.200
<b>Then come down from there.</b>

44:05.260 --> 44:06.470
<b>Look out!</b>

44:22.740 --> 44:23.910
<b>Help!</b>

44:26.120 --> 44:27.580
<b>Leave this one to me.</b>

44:28.290 --> 44:30.790
<b>Your powers are still recovering, right?</b>

44:31.710 --> 44:33.920
<b>I should be able to
use mine right about now!</b>

44:36.790 --> 44:38.050
<b>Thanks, and thanks again!</b>

44:38.130 --> 44:38.960
<b>Crap.</b>

44:39.550 --> 44:40.590
<b>What's wrong?</b>

44:40.670 --> 44:42.010
<b>I'm out of time.</b>

44:42.720 --> 44:44.220
<b>My power's about to run out.</b>

44:44.300 --> 44:45.930
<b>If that happens,
we won't be able to hold this up.</b>

44:46.010 --> 44:49.720
<b>Hey, Tony! Please help us!</b>

44:51.770 --> 44:55.190
<b>Everyone's going to be in danger!
Please help us!</b>

44:55.850 --> 44:56.860
<b>I can't.</b>

44:56.940 --> 44:59.690
<b><i>Yes, you can! You can do it!</i></b>

45:01.360 --> 45:05.280
<b>I have only five seconds left!
Five, four, three...</b>

45:14.620 --> 45:18.540
<b>Oh, this is terrible!
What are you doing?</b>

45:19.130 --> 45:21.210
<b>Watching to see how
they'll handle this situation..</b>

45:21.300 --> 45:23.550
<b>Oh my, you're sick!</b>

45:41.020 --> 45:42.940
<b>Oh, thank you, thank you!</b>

45:43.530 --> 45:44.950
<b>What just happened?</b>

45:47.200 --> 45:48.160
<b>Way to go!</b>

45:50.740 --> 45:53.410
<b>You saved us, Tony.</b>

45:54.000 --> 45:56.500
<b>That makes you a hero too.</b>

45:57.290 --> 45:58.170
<b>A hero...</b>

46:12.680 --> 46:15.140
<b>You still have some power left,
don't you?</b>

46:15.230 --> 46:19.150
<b>What? That's odd...</b>

46:26.240 --> 46:28.110
<b>Come on.
Let's go home, Kaede.</b>

46:28.610 --> 46:30.620
<b>Okay, Grandma.</b>

46:31.280 --> 46:33.660
<b>I'm so glad you're safe.</b>

46:48.220 --> 46:49.380
<b>I thought I made myself clear!</b>

46:50.140 --> 46:52.510
<b>You're supposed to
be Barnaby's second.</b>

46:52.600 --> 46:56.770
<b>Well, I know that,
but my body moved on its own.</b>

46:56.850 --> 47:00.850
<b>Unbelievable.
Leaving Barnaby behind like that...</b>

47:01.860 --> 47:05.610
<b>He said that he didn't
want to activate his powers, so—</b>

47:05.690 --> 47:08.320
<b>Then you make him do it!</b>

47:09.360 --> 47:13.370
<b>Since he is still inexperienced as a hero,
it's your job to help him out!</b>

47:13.450 --> 47:14.280
<b>What?</b>

47:15.410 --> 47:19.160
<b>Isn't it your duty as a veteran
to offer emotional support?</b>

47:19.710 --> 47:20.670
<b>Okay...</b>

47:20.750 --> 47:23.170
<b>If I can't rely on you for that,</b>

47:23.250 --> 47:25.170
<b>there's no point in keeping you
under our employment.</b>

47:25.250 --> 47:28.670
<b>The only thing you have
going for you is experience.</b>

47:31.260 --> 47:33.100
<b>Try to think of something.</b>

47:33.180 --> 47:36.430
<b>Like creating a good
work environment for Barnaby.</b>

47:37.180 --> 47:38.140
<b>Are you listening?!</b>

47:38.640 --> 47:40.390
<b>Yes, sir...</b>

47:41.980 --> 47:44.310
<b>I can't work with that man.</b>

47:45.440 --> 47:46.820
<b>He's so naïve.</b>

47:46.900 --> 47:48.900
<b>You've only just begun.</b>

47:48.990 --> 47:49.820
<b>But sir...</b>

47:50.400 --> 47:52.740
<b>It's clear that you're drawing
people's attention</b>

47:52.820 --> 47:55.080
<b>as the first superhero duo.</b>

47:55.160 --> 47:56.830
<b>This is a chance to sell your name.</b>

47:57.660 --> 47:59.830
<b>If you don't take this opportunity,</b>

47:59.910 --> 48:03.500
<b>there won't be any point to revealing
your true identity to the public.</b>

48:04.000 --> 48:05.090
<b>Am I wrong?</b>

48:06.300 --> 48:07.130
<b>No, sir.</b>

48:08.170 --> 48:10.380
<b>And by continuing this work,</b>

48:10.880 --> 48:15.640
<b>you may find a clue to uncover
the meaning behind the mark you're after.</b>

48:46.750 --> 48:48.550
<b>Don't worry.</b>

48:49.170 --> 48:51.670
<b>We will find
your parents' killer some day...</b>

49:16.410 --> 49:18.200
<b>Hey! Don't ignore me!</b>

49:21.370 --> 49:23.410
<b>Please don't waste my time.</b>

49:24.920 --> 49:29.880
<b>Man! Unfriendly as always,
huh, Lil' Bunny?</b>

49:29.960 --> 49:31.840
<b>I told you to stop calling me that.</b>

49:31.920 --> 49:34.340
<b>Well, good news!
I was thinking of—</b>

49:34.420 --> 49:35.470
<b>If you'll excuse me.</b>

49:35.550 --> 49:36.890
<b>Hey, hear me out!</b>

49:37.390 --> 49:38.970
<b>Want to go grab something to eat?</b>

49:39.050 --> 49:41.140
<b>I thought it might be something like that.</b>

49:41.810 --> 49:43.390
<b>I have stuff to do.</b>

49:43.480 --> 49:45.270
<b>Can't you spare some time?</b>

49:45.350 --> 49:46.190
<b>No.</b>

49:46.270 --> 49:48.310
<b>I've already got everyone together!</b>

49:49.480 --> 49:50.320
<b>What?</b>

49:54.780 --> 49:56.070
<b>Wow...</b>

49:56.150 --> 49:58.620
<b>What do you think of my body?</b>

49:58.700 --> 50:01.620
<b>Amazing. So this is what it looks like.</b>

50:02.200 --> 50:04.660
<b>I've only seen you use your powers
while wearing your hero suit.</b>

50:04.750 --> 50:08.210
<b>You're right.
Here, go ahead and hit me.</b>

50:08.290 --> 50:11.210
<b>I don't want to.
It looks like it would hurt.</b>

50:11.290 --> 50:12.670
<b>Don't be shy. Come on.</b>

50:12.750 --> 50:13.590
<b>This is stupid.</b>

50:13.670 --> 50:14.510
<b>Huh?</b>

50:15.420 --> 50:19.260
<b>Why do we have to do
a welcoming party for that rookie?</b>

50:19.340 --> 50:20.640
<b>I think it's nice.</b>

50:22.720 --> 50:26.560
<b>He acts aloof, but actually wants
to get along with his fellow heroes...</b>

50:26.640 --> 50:30.270
<b>He's delightfully mysterious
and handsome too.</b>

50:31.060 --> 50:36.240
<b>I wouldn't call him mysterious.
I actually know him.</b>

50:36.820 --> 50:41.990
<b>He was very popular at
the Hero Academy I went to.</b>

50:42.580 --> 50:44.910
<b>Unlike me,
he was an excellent student</b>

50:45.000 --> 50:48.210
<b>and everyone at the academy
knew who he was.</b>

50:51.460 --> 50:55.420
<b>Boy, this is the first time I've ever been
invited to something like this!</b>

50:55.510 --> 50:56.970
<b>I'm kind of nervous.</b>

50:57.670 --> 50:58.970
<b>Worry not.</b>

50:59.050 --> 51:02.140
<b>This is the first time we've gathered
together outside of work too.</b>

51:02.220 --> 51:03.810
<b>Really?</b>

51:03.890 --> 51:06.770
<b>I think today is a good opportunity.</b>

51:07.560 --> 51:11.020
<b>Let's all have fun!
And let's enjoy!</b>

51:11.610 --> 51:12.730
<b>You're right.</b>

51:12.810 --> 51:15.230
<b>If the King of Heroes says so...</b>

51:15.320 --> 51:16.860
<b>I guess...</b>

51:16.940 --> 51:18.280
<b>Sorry, guys!</b>

51:19.030 --> 51:20.780
<b>You're late, Kotetsu!</b>

51:20.860 --> 51:22.910
<b>I was busy getting dressed up
to see you guys.</b>

51:22.990 --> 51:25.370
<b>You don't need to do that.</b>

51:25.450 --> 51:27.290
<b>Barnaby's the guest of honor,
after all.</b>

51:27.370 --> 51:28.660
<b>Well, excuse me.</b>

51:30.210 --> 51:33.500
<b>So, Mister Wild... Why don't we start
by reintroducing ourselves?</b>

51:34.090 --> 51:35.460
<b>Yeah, that sounds good.</b>

51:35.550 --> 51:38.380
<b>Then me! I'll start us off.</b>

51:38.470 --> 51:39.550
<b>Go for it!</b>

51:40.130 --> 51:43.680
<b>Good evening, Handsome.
I'm Fire Emblem.</b>

51:44.180 --> 51:48.810
<b>My real name is Nathan Seymour.
I may not look it, but Helios Energy is—</b>

51:48.890 --> 51:50.190
<b>You own it, right?</b>

51:51.390 --> 51:53.190
<b>You don't need to tell me.
I already know.</b>

51:53.270 --> 51:55.070
<b>I see.</b>

51:55.150 --> 51:57.030
<b>Wow, you're such an achiever!</b>

51:57.110 --> 52:00.360
<b>Already did your research, huh?
Cool, now moving on.</b>

52:00.450 --> 52:01.450
<b>In that case...</b>

52:02.030 --> 52:03.070
<b>You don't need to.</b>

52:03.160 --> 52:03.990
<b>Huh?</b>

52:04.070 --> 52:06.080
<b>I've already done
my research on you too.</b>

52:06.580 --> 52:07.950
<b>I see.</b>

52:11.500 --> 52:13.880
<b>Hey, he's being kind of a jerk.</b>

52:13.960 --> 52:16.550
<b>He's just socially awkward.</b>

52:16.630 --> 52:20.170
<b>He's probably just nervous being
in front of the heroes he looks up to.</b>

52:20.260 --> 52:21.220
<b>Well, I'm leaving.</b>

52:21.300 --> 52:22.220
<b>Huh?</b>

52:22.300 --> 52:25.140
<b>Doing this is a waste of time.</b>

52:25.220 --> 52:26.760
<b>Now wait just a second.</b>

52:26.850 --> 52:28.220
<b>That does it!</b>

52:29.390 --> 52:31.350
<b>Just who do you think you are?</b>

52:31.940 --> 52:35.190
<b>We came here because you said
that you wanted to get along with us.</b>

52:35.770 --> 52:38.150
<b>What? I never said that.</b>

52:38.780 --> 52:42.360
<b>Weren't you the ones who wanted
to get to know me?</b>

52:42.900 --> 52:43.780
<b>- Huh?
- Huh?</b>

52:43.860 --> 52:46.160
<b>What's the meaning of this,
Mister Wild?</b>

52:46.240 --> 52:49.740
<b>You said that Handsome
wanted to meet us.</b>

52:50.330 --> 52:52.120
<b>I was told that
you all wanted to meet me.</b>

52:52.660 --> 52:54.710
<b>Uh, well...</b>

52:54.790 --> 52:55.750
<b>Kotetsu!</b>

52:55.830 --> 52:58.800
<b>Well, I thought that it would
be easier for Bunny to work</b>

52:58.880 --> 53:00.670
<b>if he was friends with everyone.</b>

53:00.760 --> 53:03.090
<b>Does that mean that you lied?</b>

53:03.180 --> 53:04.010
<b>Sort of...</b>

53:04.090 --> 53:05.180
<b>I'm appalled.</b>

53:05.260 --> 53:06.220
<b>You're despicable.</b>

53:06.300 --> 53:09.850
<b>Wait a second. I don't understand
what we're talking about.</b>

53:09.930 --> 53:10.930
<b>What's going on?!</b>

53:11.020 --> 53:12.730
<b>I'll explain it to you later.</b>

53:13.350 --> 53:15.690
<b>But don't you guys think
this is a great opportunity</b>

53:15.770 --> 53:17.360
<b>for us to all get along?</b>

53:17.440 --> 53:19.730
<b>Get along? Are you stupid?</b>

53:20.730 --> 53:22.150
<b>We're rivals.</b>

53:24.240 --> 53:26.280
<b>Well, I'll be going now.</b>

53:27.990 --> 53:29.370
<b>Hey, Bunny...!</b>

53:29.990 --> 53:32.660
<b>What a drag.</b>

53:32.750 --> 53:33.580
<b>I'm leaving.</b>

53:33.660 --> 53:34.500
<b>Huh?</b>

53:39.500 --> 53:40.500
<b>I need to tend to my shuriken.</b>

53:40.590 --> 53:42.420
<b>I suppose I'll go take John
for a walk now.</b>

53:42.510 --> 53:45.010
<b>No, wait...</b>

53:45.090 --> 53:46.760
<b>Huh?</b>

53:47.800 --> 53:48.930
<b>Bonjour, heroes!</b>

53:49.510 --> 53:51.680
<b>Something big just happened over
at the Stern Medaille area.</b>

53:52.270 --> 53:54.850
<b>A thief has stolen an item
worth billions of Stern Dollars.</b>

53:54.940 --> 53:56.520
<b>I need you to head
over there immediately!</b>

54:04.530 --> 54:06.530
<b>Oh dear. I'm afraid of the dark.</b>

54:06.610 --> 54:07.820
<b>Hey! Hands off!</b>

54:10.240 --> 54:12.040
<b>Now I'm not scared.</b>

54:12.120 --> 54:14.450
<b>You're scaring me!
I'm going on ahead!</b>

54:19.250 --> 54:22.460
<b>Transporter, meet up at South Park
over on Ninth Avenue.</b>

54:22.960 --> 54:23.880
<b>Huh?</b>

54:36.730 --> 54:37.940
<b>Wow...</b>

54:38.730 --> 54:41.900
<b>I wonder if my ears would
stretch out if I wore those.</b>

54:41.980 --> 54:44.650
<b>What? You want to try them out?</b>

54:44.730 --> 54:45.690
<b>No, I'm fine!</b>

54:52.830 --> 54:55.620
<b>Umm... Why are you running?</b>

54:55.700 --> 54:57.250
<b>It's faster than walking, isn't it?</b>

54:58.540 --> 54:59.920
<b>That's not what I meant.</b>

55:00.000 --> 55:02.500
<b>If you can control the wind,
why can't you just fly?</b>

55:02.590 --> 55:03.420
<b>I can't.</b>

55:04.130 --> 55:08.050
<b>In order to reach that flight speed,
I need a jetpack.</b>

55:09.550 --> 55:11.470
<b>So without that...</b>

55:11.550 --> 55:14.470
<b>That's right! I'll just float!</b>

55:16.430 --> 55:17.850
<b>Mr. Sky High!</b>

55:19.940 --> 55:24.070
<b>Man, today is just one incident
after another.</b>

55:37.120 --> 55:39.290
<b>One, two, three...</b>

55:50.380 --> 55:51.550
<b>Whoa!</b>

56:09.990 --> 56:10.900
<b>All right!</b>

56:14.660 --> 56:15.490
<b>Okay!</b>

56:22.920 --> 56:24.540
<b>Ready!</b>

56:38.520 --> 56:42.310
<b><i>The suspect is still on the run</i>
<i>with the Statue of Justice!</i></b>

56:43.350 --> 56:44.310
<b>Hey, isn't that...</b>

56:44.900 --> 56:45.810
<b>That's right.</b>

56:45.900 --> 56:49.570
<b>It's the symbol of peace that Mr. Legend
recovered from some criminals long ago.</b>

56:50.150 --> 56:53.950
<b>Do you know what'll happen
if the suspect gets away with it?</b>

56:54.700 --> 56:58.200
<b>It'll make people lose
their faith in heroes.</b>

56:58.280 --> 57:01.250
<b><i>So make sure you bring it back!</i>
<i>You must!</i></b>

57:23.390 --> 57:24.560
<b><i>Hold it right there!</i></b>

57:25.150 --> 57:27.230
<b>I don't want to!</b>

57:27.860 --> 57:28.860
<b>Fire!</b>

57:32.860 --> 57:33.700
<b>Come back!</b>

57:34.320 --> 57:35.700
<b>Yahoo!</b>

57:36.490 --> 57:39.080
<b><i>The suspect has evaded the police</i>
<i>and is on the run!</i></b>

57:39.160 --> 57:41.870
<b><i>We still don't see any heroes!</i></b>

57:42.450 --> 57:44.460
<b>Come on,
what's taking them so long?!</b>

57:44.540 --> 57:45.370
<b>There they are!</b>

57:47.460 --> 57:51.250
<b><i>Look! The new team,</i>
<i>Tiger &amp; Barnaby are on the scene!</i></b>

57:51.340 --> 57:54.340
<b><i>Will they make the arrest</i>
<i>with their teamwork?!</i></b>

57:59.220 --> 58:00.470
<b>Oh! I see him.</b>

58:01.640 --> 58:03.480
<b>Please don't do anything funny, okay?</b>

58:03.560 --> 58:06.730
<b>I know. Just hurry up
and catch him.</b>

58:09.650 --> 58:12.190
<b>There's a construction barricade up ahead.
Let's split up.</b>

58:12.280 --> 58:13.190
<b>What?</b>

58:24.870 --> 58:27.920
<b>That was close! Wha—?!</b>

58:33.800 --> 58:34.800
<b>Out of the way!</b>

58:36.510 --> 58:38.180
<b>This is bad. Our points!</b>

58:48.850 --> 58:53.690
<b><i>Blue Rose, Barnaby Brooks Jr.,</i>
<i>and Wild Tiger...</i></b>

58:53.780 --> 58:56.820
<b><i>Who will reach the suspect first?!</i></b>

59:00.570 --> 59:03.950
<b>Now's not the time for a car chase!</b>

59:08.040 --> 59:08.960
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

59:16.170 --> 59:17.260
<b>But how?!</b>

59:19.430 --> 59:20.260
<b>Huh?</b>

59:20.840 --> 59:23.260
<b><i>The suspect is nowhere to be seen!</i></b>

59:23.850 --> 59:25.930
<b><i>Where did he go?</i></b>

59:27.480 --> 59:29.730
<b>It's your fault we lost him!</b>

59:30.810 --> 59:31.940
<b>So...</b>

59:33.820 --> 59:36.480
<b>Why are you here, granny?</b>

59:51.750 --> 59:52.580
<b>Watch it!</b>

59:53.380 --> 59:54.290
<b>Yahoo!</b>

59:54.380 --> 59:55.380
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

59:56.460 --> 59:57.460
<b>Oh, great...</b>

59:58.460 --> 01:00:00.880
<b>I never expected him to escape
into an amusement park.</b>

01:00:01.470 --> 01:00:04.140
<b>Well, we do want him to make this
look more exciting for us.</b>

01:00:09.980 --> 01:00:10.890
<b>Hey, watch it!</b>

01:00:16.320 --> 01:00:17.320
<b>Oh?</b>

01:00:19.740 --> 01:00:23.280
<b><i>Standing in his way is Rock Bison!</i></b>

01:00:24.200 --> 01:00:25.660
<b>These points are mine!</b>

01:00:25.740 --> 01:00:29.040
<b><i>And look! Dragon Kid is here too!</i></b>

01:00:29.120 --> 01:00:30.250
<b>I'm going ahead of you!</b>

01:00:30.330 --> 01:00:31.870
<b>All right!</b>

01:00:42.380 --> 01:00:44.300
<b>Bye bye!</b>

01:00:46.050 --> 01:00:47.060
<b>Sorry... Oh.</b>

01:00:48.220 --> 01:00:49.140
<b>Huh?</b>

01:00:53.770 --> 01:00:55.060
<b>What?</b>

01:00:56.900 --> 01:00:57.820
<b>What?!</b>

01:00:57.900 --> 01:00:59.730
<b>Look out!</b>

01:00:59.820 --> 01:01:01.240
<b>Mikey!</b>

01:01:04.240 --> 01:01:05.660
<b>Now hurry!</b>

01:01:05.740 --> 01:01:07.830
<b>Mikey! Mikey! Mikey!</b>

01:01:09.870 --> 01:01:13.790
<b><i>They stopped it!</i>
<i>But how did this happen?!</i></b>

01:01:15.960 --> 01:01:16.790
<b>Hm?</b>

01:01:18.590 --> 01:01:23.380
<b><i>And here comes...Sky High!</i></b>

01:01:24.300 --> 01:01:25.590
<b>Hmm...</b>

01:01:25.680 --> 01:01:26.680
<b>Stop right there!</b>

01:01:27.350 --> 01:01:29.350
<b>Heh! Don't point!</b>

01:01:31.770 --> 01:01:34.390
<b>Sky High!</b>

01:01:40.690 --> 01:01:41.530
<b>Bye!</b>

01:01:43.240 --> 01:01:45.070
<b><i>Wow, what happened?</i></b>

01:01:52.830 --> 01:01:53.790
<b>Whoops!</b>

01:02:00.210 --> 01:02:01.050
<b>There!</b>

01:02:04.220 --> 01:02:05.220
<b>Huh?</b>

01:02:10.510 --> 01:02:11.640
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

01:02:12.430 --> 01:02:14.140
<b>High! And high!</b>

01:02:21.520 --> 01:02:22.650
<b>Oh my...</b>

01:02:22.730 --> 01:02:23.860
<b>Yes!</b>

01:02:25.240 --> 01:02:27.070
<b><i>He truly is the King of Heroes!</i></b>

01:02:27.160 --> 01:02:29.450
<b><i>The wind seems to be blowing</i>
<i>in his favor for this season as well!</i></b>

01:02:30.580 --> 01:02:34.500
<b>Now, hand over the Statue of Justice!</b>

01:02:34.580 --> 01:02:37.620
<b>If you want it that badly,
come and get it.</b>

01:02:38.120 --> 01:02:39.040
<b>What?!</b>

01:02:40.750 --> 01:02:43.670
<b><i>But how?!</i></b>

01:02:56.310 --> 01:02:58.390
<b>Let's put an end to this chase.</b>

01:02:58.480 --> 01:03:02.480
<b>Are you sure it's really over?</b>

01:03:02.570 --> 01:03:06.240
<b>My ice is a little bit cold,</b>

01:03:06.320 --> 01:03:07.650
<b>but your crime—</b>

01:03:07.740 --> 01:03:10.160
<b>You're taking too long!</b>

01:03:10.240 --> 01:03:11.570
<b>Don't interfere!</b>

01:03:11.660 --> 01:03:16.580
<b>If you have time to say all that,
then hurry up and put him on hold!</b>

01:03:17.210 --> 01:03:19.420
<b>Hey! Don't steal my points!</b>

01:03:24.630 --> 01:03:26.800
<b>You're breaking the rules!</b>

01:03:26.880 --> 01:03:28.590
<b>No, that's what you're doing!</b>

01:03:28.670 --> 01:03:31.300
<b><i>What in the world just happened?!</i></b>

01:03:31.390 --> 01:03:32.600
<b>That's odd.</b>

01:03:32.680 --> 01:03:35.180
<b>He shouldn't be able to escape them.</b>

01:03:36.640 --> 01:03:38.520
<b>It's Sky High!</b>

01:03:39.230 --> 01:03:41.850
<b><i>The heroes are stalled and</i>
<i>unable to arrest the suspect.</i></b>

01:03:45.980 --> 01:03:46.900
<b>Oh! There he is!</b>

01:03:49.070 --> 01:03:52.370
<b>Wait. You promised not
to do anything funny.</b>

01:03:52.450 --> 01:03:55.370
<b>Huh? Did I make such a promise?</b>

01:03:55.990 --> 01:03:57.370
<b><i>You really are annoying...</i></b>

01:03:57.450 --> 01:04:01.620
<b>Then what should we do?
He seems to be pretty quick.</b>

01:04:02.210 --> 01:04:03.630
<b>No matter how fast he is,</b>

01:04:03.710 --> 01:04:06.170
<b>he can't escape from us
if we activate our powers</b>

01:04:06.250 --> 01:04:07.670
<b>and flank him from both sides.</b>

01:04:07.760 --> 01:04:09.050
<b>Flank him from both sides, huh?</b>

01:04:09.630 --> 01:04:10.800
<b>You'll do as I say.</b>

01:04:11.590 --> 01:04:15.050
<b>This is the perfect chance to show people
that we're a team.</b>

01:04:15.560 --> 01:04:17.680
<b>I don't care what we do
as long as we arrest him.</b>

01:04:17.770 --> 01:04:20.850
<b>Then go around to the other side.
I'll come from this side.</b>

01:04:21.350 --> 01:04:22.270
<b>You got it!</b>

01:04:32.200 --> 01:04:33.610
<b>Give it up already.</b>

01:04:33.700 --> 01:04:35.320
<b>So now I get the rookie, huh?</b>

01:04:35.910 --> 01:04:38.370
<b>It's not just the rookie!</b>

01:04:40.040 --> 01:04:41.040
<b>Now!</b>

01:04:53.760 --> 01:04:54.760
<b>Why are you here?!</b>

01:04:54.840 --> 01:04:56.010
<b>How should I know?!</b>

01:05:01.890 --> 01:05:04.480
<b>It was a pretty good idea.</b>

01:05:04.560 --> 01:05:07.940
<b>But that's not gonna be enough
to catch me!</b>

01:05:35.470 --> 01:05:37.760
<b>Ms. Agnes, it's Barnaby.</b>

01:05:37.850 --> 01:05:38.680
<b>What is it?</b>

01:05:38.760 --> 01:05:40.600
<b><i>I have a request to make.</i></b>

01:05:42.310 --> 01:05:44.190
<b><i>Everyone, Barnaby has</i>
<i>something to tell us. </i></b>

01:05:44.890 --> 01:05:46.900
<b><i>I'm opening up all channels.</i></b>

01:05:46.980 --> 01:05:50.780
<b><i>Hi, this is Barnaby.</i>
<i>I've figured out the suspect's power.</i></b>

01:05:50.860 --> 01:05:52.900
<b><i>It seems to be location switching.</i></b>

01:05:53.490 --> 01:05:54.400
<b>Location switching?</b>

01:05:54.490 --> 01:05:58.660
<b><i>He can switch places with</i>
<i>anyone in his sight.</i></b>

01:05:58.740 --> 01:06:00.160
<b>So that's what happened!</b>

01:06:00.240 --> 01:06:03.040
<b><i>There's something I want</i>
<i>all of you to do.</i></b>

01:06:03.620 --> 01:06:06.620
<b>No! Why do we have
to listen to you?!</b>

01:06:13.970 --> 01:06:15.260
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

01:06:15.340 --> 01:06:16.840
<b>What are you doing?</b>

01:06:16.930 --> 01:06:17.760
<b>But...</b>

01:06:24.310 --> 01:06:27.270
<b><i>Try not to harm any civilians.</i></b>

01:06:28.020 --> 01:06:31.110
<b><i>We heroes must protect the people.</i></b>

01:06:34.570 --> 01:06:36.900
<b><i>Attention visitors.</i></b>

01:06:36.990 --> 01:06:40.490
<b><i>There is a criminal with NEXT powers</i>
<i>in the park.</i></b>

01:06:41.120 --> 01:06:43.490
<b><i>Please follow our staff member's</i>
<i>directions to move to safety.</i></b>

01:06:44.160 --> 01:06:47.000
<b><i>I repeat. Please follow our staff member's</i>
<i>directions to move to safety.</i></b>

01:06:47.580 --> 01:06:50.750
<b>I had you all wrong.
You do care about the people.</b>

01:06:50.840 --> 01:06:52.210
<b>Don't get the wrong idea.</b>

01:06:53.340 --> 01:06:56.840
<b>I did that so I wouldn't ruin
HERO TV's image.</b>

01:06:56.920 --> 01:07:00.340
<b>Also, this will make it difficult
for the other heroes to interfere.</b>

01:07:01.260 --> 01:07:03.100
<b>This is my chance to steal the glory.</b>

01:07:03.180 --> 01:07:07.230
<b>Huh? That's so petty.</b>

01:07:07.310 --> 01:07:11.520
<b>You should be thanking me.
You'll get to stand out because of me.</b>

01:07:11.610 --> 01:07:13.730
<b>Yeah, yeah... Thank you very much.</b>

01:07:14.530 --> 01:07:18.280
<b>The problem is that our power
has run out.</b>

01:07:18.360 --> 01:07:21.030
<b>We need to make a plan
until we recover.</b>

01:07:21.570 --> 01:07:22.990
<b>I have a good idea.</b>

01:07:23.080 --> 01:07:24.490
<b>- Denied.
-Listen to me!</b>

01:07:25.080 --> 01:07:26.410
<b>It's probably nothing good.</b>

01:07:26.500 --> 01:07:27.580
<b>What did you say?!</b>

01:07:29.330 --> 01:07:32.790
<b>Whose idea was it
that made us use up our powers, huh?</b>

01:07:32.880 --> 01:07:34.460
<b>You agreed to it.</b>

01:07:34.550 --> 01:07:35.880
<b>No, I didn't.</b>

01:07:35.960 --> 01:07:41.090
<b>I was planning on going boom
and bam from the beginning!</b>

01:07:41.840 --> 01:07:43.100
<b>You're not making any sense to me.</b>

01:07:43.180 --> 01:07:45.010
<b>It means to just go for it!</b>

01:07:45.100 --> 01:07:49.350
<b>I don't expect a plan coming
from someone like you to work.</b>

01:07:49.440 --> 01:07:53.310
<b>Well I'm not going to waste my time
on plans made by some egghead like you!</b>

01:07:57.230 --> 01:08:00.950
<b>Hey! Why are you fighting
at a time like this?!</b>

01:08:01.450 --> 01:08:03.240
<b>I've got some information
from the Justice Bureau.</b>

01:08:03.820 --> 01:08:05.790
<b>The suspect's name is Robin Baxter.</b>

01:08:05.870 --> 01:08:08.580
<b>He's an internationally known robber.</b>

01:08:09.160 --> 01:08:11.870
<b>We have reports of his crimes
from many countries.</b>

01:08:11.960 --> 01:08:15.380
<b>But he's never been arrested.
He's gotten away every time.</b>

01:08:16.050 --> 01:08:17.880
<b>Now quit squabbling!</b>

01:08:17.960 --> 01:08:20.840
<b>If you do that again,
I'll take points from you!</b>

01:08:20.930 --> 01:08:21.760
<b>- Okay.
- Yes, ma'am.</b>

01:08:23.300 --> 01:08:26.890
<b><i>The heroes are calling</i>
<i>on the citizens to evacuate.</i></b>

01:08:28.560 --> 01:08:29.850
<b>Oh?</b>

01:08:30.850 --> 01:08:36.610
<b>What's going on?!
We already paid to get in!</b>

01:08:37.730 --> 01:08:39.360
<b>Hurry up and catch him!</b>

01:08:41.570 --> 01:08:42.910
<b>Hello, Daddy.</b>

01:08:44.240 --> 01:08:45.200
<b>There he is!</b>

01:08:50.830 --> 01:08:51.910
<b>Are you all right?</b>

01:08:52.460 --> 01:08:53.290
<b>Yes.</b>

01:08:53.370 --> 01:08:54.630
<b>That bastard!</b>

01:09:02.420 --> 01:09:03.630
<b>Move out of the way!</b>

01:09:04.300 --> 01:09:06.140
<b>Look out! Hey!</b>

01:09:06.850 --> 01:09:08.600
<b>The suspect seems to be moving
towards the exit.</b>

01:09:08.680 --> 01:09:10.350
<b>Let's head him off!</b>

01:09:10.430 --> 01:09:13.140
<b>Huh? Hey! Listen to
what I have to say!</b>

01:09:14.190 --> 01:09:16.560
<b>I'm over here!</b>

01:09:32.580 --> 01:09:35.750
<b>So now it's the guy
in the Mohawk suit?</b>

01:09:36.460 --> 01:09:38.250
<b>What, did you prefer
Lil' Bunny instead?</b>

01:09:47.720 --> 01:09:48.850
<b>You called?</b>

01:09:52.020 --> 01:09:53.930
<b>I'm done burning all the calories.</b>

01:09:54.850 --> 01:09:56.980
<b>Let's put an end to this.</b>

01:09:57.060 --> 01:09:58.770
<b>There's nowhere to run.</b>

01:09:58.860 --> 01:10:02.110
<b>Heh... You're such fools!</b>

01:10:03.780 --> 01:10:05.650
<b>Who are you calling a fool?!</b>

01:10:09.870 --> 01:10:11.370
<b>What?!</b>

01:10:11.450 --> 01:10:14.080
<b>Come on! What's wrong?
Try to trade places.</b>

01:10:14.710 --> 01:10:17.580
<b>You can switch places
with either of us. Come on!</b>

01:10:21.210 --> 01:10:23.300
<b>You really are fools.</b>

01:10:24.010 --> 01:10:25.930
<b>What?! You're not going
to switch places?!</b>

01:10:28.180 --> 01:10:29.010
<b>Huh?</b>

01:10:30.010 --> 01:10:34.180
<b><i>Hey, Tiger &amp; Barnaby! Showing off to</i>
<i>the public how close you two are</i></b>

01:10:34.270 --> 01:10:35.810
<b><i>won't help catch the suspect!</i></b>

01:10:38.150 --> 01:10:40.360
<b>Could you let go of me?</b>

01:10:41.480 --> 01:10:43.110
<b>What kind of plan is this?</b>

01:10:43.190 --> 01:10:45.400
<b>I thought that he would switch places.</b>

01:10:45.490 --> 01:10:48.910
<b>The suspect would never fall
for such a childish trap.</b>

01:10:49.410 --> 01:10:51.450
<b>This is going to make people
change the channel.</b>

01:10:52.530 --> 01:10:57.160
<b>Change the channel? Listen, our goal
is not about being on TV!</b>

01:10:57.870 --> 01:10:58.790
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

01:10:59.250 --> 01:11:00.380
<b>Hey! Don't you get it?!</b>

01:11:01.000 --> 01:11:02.710
<b>What was that stunt
you pulled back there?!</b>

01:11:03.460 --> 01:11:05.300
<b>We're supposed to be
protecting the people.</b>

01:11:05.380 --> 01:11:07.680
<b>You're the one who told me to
put pressure on the suspect!</b>

01:11:07.760 --> 01:11:08.840
<b>What did you say?!</b>

01:11:08.930 --> 01:11:09.760
<b>What's your problem?!</b>

01:11:09.840 --> 01:11:12.390
<b>Ugh, they're at it again!</b>

01:11:12.970 --> 01:11:15.890
<b><i>Robin Baxter has committed</i>
<i>many robberies around the world</i></b>

01:11:15.980 --> 01:11:17.890
<b><i>and is formidable.</i></b>

01:11:18.520 --> 01:11:22.150
<b><i>The heroes are closing off</i>
<i>the amusement park</i></b>

01:11:22.230 --> 01:11:23.570
<b><i>to keep him from escaping.</i></b>

01:11:24.730 --> 01:11:27.110
<b><i>And we're now seeing</i>
<i>the park visitors</i></b>

01:11:27.190 --> 01:11:29.030
<b><i>being led to safety by the heroes.</i></b>

01:11:31.370 --> 01:11:33.780
<b><i>Sky High!</i></b>

01:11:34.410 --> 01:11:37.200
<b><i>Looks like we're being</i>
<i>pushed out as well!</i></b>

01:11:38.290 --> 01:11:41.000
<b><i>This area is currently closed.</i></b>

01:11:41.080 --> 01:11:45.210
<b><i>Visitors are to follow orders</i>
<i>and head to the gates right away.</i></b>

01:12:00.310 --> 01:12:02.230
<b>Everyone! Stay where you are!</b>

01:12:11.990 --> 01:12:13.660
<b>It's him...</b>

01:12:15.530 --> 01:12:16.790
<b>You come this way too.</b>

01:12:16.870 --> 01:12:18.290
<b>What? What?</b>

01:12:18.370 --> 01:12:19.960
<b>Gather together right now!</b>

01:12:20.040 --> 01:12:21.790
<b>Everyone! Stay where you are!</b>

01:12:24.170 --> 01:12:25.170
<b>What's going on?</b>

01:12:25.250 --> 01:12:26.590
<b>You're not very bright, are you?</b>

01:12:26.670 --> 01:12:29.380
<b>This area has just been shut off
from the outside!</b>

01:12:29.470 --> 01:12:30.380
<b>And?</b>

01:12:31.010 --> 01:12:32.930
<b>If we gather everyone here,</b>

01:12:33.010 --> 01:12:36.680
<b>he won't be able to get outside,
no matter who he switches places with.</b>

01:12:37.560 --> 01:12:41.520
<b>I guess not all of you are stupid.</b>

01:12:42.100 --> 01:12:45.730
<b>We just have to think of
a way to catch him, Mister Wild.</b>

01:12:45.810 --> 01:12:48.530
<b>Wow, you guys are pretty smart.</b>

01:12:50.280 --> 01:12:54.160
<b>How long do I have to do this?</b>

01:12:57.200 --> 01:12:58.040
<b>Hey.</b>

01:12:58.660 --> 01:12:59.500
<b>No! Come back.</b>

01:13:08.800 --> 01:13:10.210
<b>Help me!</b>

01:13:11.130 --> 01:13:14.180
<b>Thank you!</b>

01:13:18.180 --> 01:13:19.350
<b>Damn it!</b>

01:13:19.890 --> 01:13:21.350
<b>That's what he gets for not listening.</b>

01:13:21.430 --> 01:13:22.680
<b>Come on, let's go save him!</b>

01:13:22.770 --> 01:13:24.650
<b>You can handle that by yourself.</b>

01:13:25.150 --> 01:13:26.150
<b>I need to catch the suspect.</b>

01:13:26.230 --> 01:13:27.860
<b>Dad!</b>

01:13:30.070 --> 01:13:31.440
<b>Dad!</b>

01:13:31.940 --> 01:13:33.490
<b>Don't move!</b>

01:13:35.610 --> 01:13:36.620
<b>Huh? Huh?</b>

01:13:42.080 --> 01:13:43.460
<b>What?</b>

01:13:47.750 --> 01:13:48.630
<b>Dad!</b>

01:13:55.720 --> 01:13:59.140
<b>Sir, don't let go of your son.</b>

01:14:00.010 --> 01:14:04.810
<b>Remember, you're his only father.
No one can replace you.</b>

01:14:05.940 --> 01:14:06.900
<b>I won't.</b>

01:14:09.520 --> 01:14:11.860
<b>Do you like children?</b>

01:14:11.940 --> 01:14:12.820
<b>Huh?</b>

01:14:12.900 --> 01:14:14.900
<b>I mean, you did all that for the boy...</b>

01:14:16.030 --> 01:14:17.410
<b>And earlier in the day...</b>

01:14:21.120 --> 01:14:23.290
<b>It's kind of unexpected...</b>

01:14:25.620 --> 01:14:27.420
<b>There's no special reason for it.</b>

01:14:30.420 --> 01:14:33.380
<b><i>The heroes are headed towards</i>
<i>the park attraction</i></b>

01:14:33.460 --> 01:14:35.380
<b><i>that Robin escaped to!</i></b>

01:14:36.010 --> 01:14:38.390
<b>Usually, things are largely
in their favor.</b>

01:14:38.470 --> 01:14:40.180
<b>But this time,
it's the other way around.</b>

01:14:40.260 --> 01:14:43.220
<b>This stalemate might continue on.</b>

01:14:43.310 --> 01:14:44.430
<b>I have some bad news.</b>

01:14:45.020 --> 01:14:47.190
<b>I found out that the roller coaster
the suspect escaped to...</b>

01:14:47.270 --> 01:14:50.940
<b>stretches from the core
to the upper areas of Stern Bild.</b>

01:14:51.730 --> 01:14:53.650
<b>The long vertical tunnel is split up</b>

01:14:53.730 --> 01:14:57.030
<b>into the Green Zone, the Mirror Zone,
and the Sky Zone.</b>

01:14:57.110 --> 01:15:00.620
<b>We've closed off the emergency escapes
all the way up to the upper areas,</b>

01:15:01.160 --> 01:15:03.200
<b>but once he passes the Sky Zone,</b>

01:15:03.290 --> 01:15:06.120
<b>he can see the entire city from
the observation deck.</b>

01:15:06.210 --> 01:15:08.370
<b>So if the suspect makes it there...</b>

01:15:09.000 --> 01:15:11.210
<b><i>He can switch places</i>
<i>with anyone in the city.</i></b>

01:15:11.290 --> 01:15:12.460
<b>Oh, no...</b>

01:15:12.540 --> 01:15:16.720
<b><i>You must catch him before he gets</i>
<i>to the observation deck!</i></b>

01:15:16.800 --> 01:15:20.760
<b>At this rate, he's going to get away
with the Statue of Justice.</b>

01:15:20.840 --> 01:15:23.220
<b>But if we go near him,
he'll switch places with someone else.</b>

01:15:24.430 --> 01:15:27.480
<b>Maybe we should destroy
the entire building.</b>

01:15:27.560 --> 01:15:30.060
<b>I shudder to think of how much
we'd have to pay in damages.</b>

01:15:31.270 --> 01:15:33.730
<b>What a truly despicable bastard.</b>

01:15:37.650 --> 01:15:40.740
<b><i>Robin has just passed the Green Zone</i>
<i>and entered the Mirror Zone!</i></b>

01:15:41.280 --> 01:15:42.570
<b>What?! Already?!</b>

01:15:42.660 --> 01:15:45.580
<b>Don't pressure us!
We're still thinking right now!</b>

01:15:45.660 --> 01:15:48.000
<b>Damn it,
this is getting us nowhere!</b>

01:15:48.960 --> 01:15:50.750
<b>I'm going to capture him head on.</b>

01:15:50.830 --> 01:15:52.830
<b>You'll just fail again.</b>

01:15:54.170 --> 01:15:56.380
<b>You're coming too!
I'll provide you with support!</b>

01:15:56.460 --> 01:15:58.920
<b>That's what worries me the most.</b>

01:15:59.010 --> 01:16:02.550
<b>What?! And here I was offering
to act as your decoy!</b>

01:16:03.890 --> 01:16:04.810
<b>That's it!</b>

01:16:05.600 --> 01:16:06.810
<b>What? What is it?</b>

01:16:06.890 --> 01:16:08.140
<b>Don't follow me!</b>

01:16:08.230 --> 01:16:11.100
<b>Huh? But we're supposed
to be a team.</b>

01:16:11.650 --> 01:16:14.570
<b>I will capture the suspect!</b>

01:16:23.660 --> 01:16:26.950
<b>Hey! Are you just going to let
the rookie go off on his own?!</b>

01:16:41.050 --> 01:16:44.890
<b><i>Hurry! Robin Baxter is going to be</i>
<i>leaving the Mirror Zone soon!</i></b>

01:16:59.360 --> 01:17:00.610
<b>Huh?</b>

01:17:02.610 --> 01:17:03.780
<b>Hmm...</b>

01:17:06.830 --> 01:17:09.450
<b>The suspect is about to reach
the observation deck!</b>

01:17:10.660 --> 01:17:12.540
<b>What is Barnaby doing?!</b>

01:17:16.630 --> 01:17:18.920
<b>You've given us quite a difficult time!</b>

01:17:20.630 --> 01:17:24.970
<b>It's over! We are going to capture you!</b>

01:17:28.640 --> 01:17:31.810
<b>There's no way a foolish team
like yours can do that!</b>

01:17:36.940 --> 01:17:38.440
<b>We'll see about that.</b>

01:17:47.120 --> 01:17:49.330
<b>What? Huh?</b>

01:17:50.200 --> 01:17:53.540
<b>What's wrong?
Your goal is just up ahead.</b>

01:18:14.640 --> 01:18:16.770
<b><i>Powers exhausted in 30 seconds...</i></b>

01:18:26.240 --> 01:18:28.660
<b>Damn it! I can't see!</b>

01:18:43.300 --> 01:18:44.550
<b>It's over.</b>

01:18:45.260 --> 01:18:46.970
<b>I've captured Robin Baxter.</b>

01:18:51.760 --> 01:18:53.430
<b><i>He's finally done it!</i></b>

01:18:53.520 --> 01:18:58.730
<b><i>The rookie hero, Barnaby Brooks Jr.,</i>
<i>has captured Robin Baxter!</i></b>

01:18:58.810 --> 01:19:03.230
<b><i>He has successfully returned</i>
<i>the Statue of Justice back to Stern Bild!</i></b>

01:19:08.200 --> 01:19:09.820
<b>He's so cool!</b>

01:19:09.910 --> 01:19:11.410
<b>Amazing!</b>

01:19:13.410 --> 01:19:16.080
<b>Wow, that was exciting.</b>

01:19:16.160 --> 01:19:17.870
<b>Our numbers are skyrocketing!</b>

01:19:17.960 --> 01:19:22.040
<b>All right! Let's shoot
a special documentary on Barnaby!</b>

01:19:22.750 --> 01:19:26.550
<b><i>The heroes are now turning Robin</i>
<i>over to the police.</i></b>

01:19:27.840 --> 01:19:29.550
<b>Is this all they've got?</b>

01:19:38.230 --> 01:19:39.060
<b>Oh...</b>

01:19:41.860 --> 01:19:46.900
<b>Congratulations. You did great,
Lil' Bunny.</b>

01:19:47.400 --> 01:19:50.740
<b>How many times must I tell you
not to call me that?</b>

01:19:50.820 --> 01:19:53.070
<b>Are you still in a bad mood?</b>

01:19:53.160 --> 01:19:56.330
<b>Isn't it about time
we put this behind us?</b>

01:19:57.700 --> 01:20:00.080
<b>Whoa! What's with that look?</b>

01:20:00.710 --> 01:20:02.500
<b>What exactly did you do today?</b>

01:20:02.580 --> 01:20:03.420
<b>Huh?</b>

01:20:03.500 --> 01:20:05.710
<b>You talked big,</b>

01:20:05.800 --> 01:20:08.670
<b>but all you did was get in my way.</b>

01:20:09.260 --> 01:20:11.180
<b>You don't have to say it like that!</b>

01:20:13.680 --> 01:20:14.930
<b>Good work.</b>

01:20:15.560 --> 01:20:16.560
<b>Oh...</b>

01:20:18.270 --> 01:20:19.310
<b>Thank you.</b>

01:20:19.390 --> 01:20:22.600
<b>Man, today sure was a long day!</b>

01:20:22.690 --> 01:20:24.440
<b>I wasn't talking to you.</b>

01:20:24.520 --> 01:20:27.190
<b>Besides, you haven't done
anything exhausting!</b>

01:20:28.030 --> 01:20:30.360
<b>No, I did stuff too—</b>

01:20:30.450 --> 01:20:32.280
<b>You were very impressive.</b>

01:20:33.030 --> 01:20:34.780
<b>I want you to keep it up.</b>

01:20:34.870 --> 01:20:35.700
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

01:20:38.660 --> 01:20:40.370
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

01:20:41.290 --> 01:20:44.540
<b><i>I was so scared, you know!</i></b>

01:20:44.630 --> 01:20:49.420
<b>If only I had been there,
Daddy would have protected you.</b>

01:20:49.510 --> 01:20:51.590
<b><i>I was all right without you, Dad.</i></b>

01:20:52.220 --> 01:20:57.140
<b><i>There's a new hero called Barnaby.</i>
<i>He saved me!</i></b>

01:20:57.220 --> 01:21:01.390
<b><i>He was really cool.</i>
<i>I'm already a fan of his!</i></b>

01:21:09.990 --> 01:21:10.900
<b>Okay.</b>

01:21:10.990 --> 01:21:14.160
<b>I'll try to modify the suit
so it's a little easier to remove.</b>

01:21:14.820 --> 01:21:15.660
<b>Thank you.</b>

01:21:15.740 --> 01:21:19.160
<b>That was quite clever of you
to use the suit as a decoy.</b>

01:21:19.240 --> 01:21:21.160
<b>It was just a split decision.</b>

01:21:21.750 --> 01:21:26.130
<b>You two really are a strange team.</b>

01:21:26.210 --> 01:21:27.040
<b>Huh?</b>

01:21:27.340 --> 01:21:29.840
<b>I saw the footage that was
recorded by your suits.</b>

01:21:33.510 --> 01:21:34.800
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

01:21:40.310 --> 01:21:45.060
<b>Man... You really surprised me yesterday.</b>

01:21:47.440 --> 01:21:48.900
<b><i>Don't follow me!</i></b>

01:21:49.440 --> 01:21:52.990
<b><i>I will capture the suspect!</i></b>

01:21:57.620 --> 01:22:00.830
<b><i>Hey! Are you just going to let</i>
<i>the rookie go off on his own?!</i></b>

01:22:00.910 --> 01:22:04.040
<b><i>I have no intention of</i>
<i>following his orders.</i></b>

01:22:04.870 --> 01:22:07.710
<b><i>Handsome is going to steal</i>
<i>the best part.</i></b>

01:22:09.630 --> 01:22:10.590
<b><i>Wait!</i></b>

01:22:11.920 --> 01:22:13.800
<b><i>Could you let him handle it?</i></b>

01:22:18.550 --> 01:22:22.310
<b><i>You see, I kind of wasted three minutes</i>
<i>of his life today, so...</i></b>

01:22:22.390 --> 01:22:23.930
<b><i>What are you talking about?</i></b>

01:22:24.020 --> 01:22:25.020
<b><i>I don't get you.</i></b>

01:22:25.100 --> 01:22:26.350
<b><i>We don't have any more time!</i></b>

01:22:26.440 --> 01:22:27.270
<b><i>Mister Wild!</i></b>

01:22:27.350 --> 01:22:28.440
<b><i>They're right.</i></b>

01:22:29.060 --> 01:22:31.820
<b><i>Do you have a reason why</i>
<i>we should let Handsome handle this?</i></b>

01:22:33.230 --> 01:22:34.070
<b><i>I do have a reason!</i></b>

01:22:36.240 --> 01:22:37.820
<b><i>My gut says so!</i></b>

01:22:37.910 --> 01:22:39.160
<b><i>What?!</i></b>

01:22:39.910 --> 01:22:41.330
<b><i>He may have a small—</i></b>

01:22:41.410 --> 01:22:44.080
<b><i>no, a big problem with</i>
<i>his personality,</i></b>

01:22:44.160 --> 01:22:47.830
<b><i>but he's trying his best</i>
<i>to capture the suspect!</i></b>

01:22:48.460 --> 01:22:50.500
<b><i>I will watch over him as his partner!</i></b>

01:22:51.090 --> 01:22:55.590
<b><i>If something goes wrong,</i>
<i>I'll take responsibility! So...</i></b>

01:22:56.340 --> 01:22:57.930
<b><i>Please let him handle this!</i></b>

01:23:12.980 --> 01:23:17.400
<b><i>Please don't do anything funny.</i>
<i>Please don't do anything funny.</i></b>

01:23:20.490 --> 01:23:24.410
<b><i>You promised not to do anything funny.</i>
<i>You promised not to do anything funny.</i></b>

01:23:29.540 --> 01:23:30.670
<b><i>It's over.</i></b>

01:23:34.250 --> 01:23:35.960
<b><i>I've captured Robin Baxter.</i></b>

01:23:47.890 --> 01:23:51.480
<b>To be honest,
I was really nervous.</b>

01:23:51.560 --> 01:23:54.900
<b>I said that I'd take responsibility,
but there's nothing I could do.</b>

01:23:54.980 --> 01:23:55.860
<b>Huh?</b>

01:23:59.200 --> 01:24:02.490
<b>Well, in the end,
he made the arrest.</b>

01:24:02.570 --> 01:24:04.830
<b>I guess you were right about him.</b>

01:24:08.410 --> 01:24:10.540
<b><i>Whew... Whoa?!</i></b>

01:24:11.120 --> 01:24:12.750
<b><i>Damn, that was close!</i></b>

01:24:15.670 --> 01:24:17.340
<b>I told him not to
do anything funny...</b>

01:24:28.980 --> 01:24:33.190
<b>I couldn't sing during the broadcast
and I chipped a nail.</b>

01:24:33.270 --> 01:24:36.270
<b>Even after I went home,
I was so annoyed that I couldn't sleep</b>

01:24:36.360 --> 01:24:37.940
<b>and ended up eating ice cream
in the middle of the night!</b>

01:24:38.740 --> 01:24:40.360
<b>Hey, don't blame me for that...</b>

01:24:40.450 --> 01:24:42.700
<b>This is your partner's fault!</b>

01:24:42.780 --> 01:24:46.240
<b>Yeah, he took all the good parts.</b>

01:24:46.330 --> 01:24:47.290
<b>Even if he's handsome,</b>

01:24:47.370 --> 01:24:49.410
<b>a man without kindness won't win
the hearts of the ladies.</b>

01:24:49.500 --> 01:24:52.920
<b>Actually, he was quite popular
at the Hero Academy.</b>

01:24:53.580 --> 01:24:57.460
<b>He even had a fan club.</b>

01:24:58.760 --> 01:25:01.880
<b>I don't really understand him either.</b>

01:25:01.970 --> 01:25:04.840
<b>In that case, should we all go out
for another drink?</b>

01:25:04.930 --> 01:25:05.760
<b>- Huh?
- Huh?</b>

01:25:06.260 --> 01:25:09.890
<b>That welcoming party yesterday
was a disaster.</b>

01:25:09.970 --> 01:25:12.810
<b>So Wild Tiger is treating us all today.</b>

01:25:12.890 --> 01:25:13.730
<b>Huh?</b>

01:25:14.310 --> 01:25:17.520
<b>We did you a favor last night.</b>

01:25:17.610 --> 01:25:19.690
<b>Don't you want to repay
the debt as soon as possible?</b>

01:25:20.190 --> 01:25:21.950
<b>You're so pushy.</b>

01:25:22.030 --> 01:25:24.200
<b>Well, I guess I don't mind
if he's treating us.</b>

01:25:24.280 --> 01:25:25.160
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:25:25.240 --> 01:25:28.120
<b>We can't let your feelings
go to waste.</b>

01:25:28.200 --> 01:25:29.790
<b>If you're all going,
then I'll go too!</b>

01:25:31.080 --> 01:25:34.170
<b>I'd like a place where
I can drink miso soup.</b>

01:25:41.090 --> 01:25:43.510
<b>Well, I'll meet you all there.</b>

01:25:44.720 --> 01:25:45.930
<b>Come on, this way!</b>

01:25:47.300 --> 01:25:48.300
<b>Out of the way.</b>

01:25:49.390 --> 01:25:52.020
<b>Yay! Hurry!</b>

01:25:57.230 --> 01:25:59.940
<b>Oh well. Tomoe...</b>

01:26:02.190 --> 01:26:05.860
<b>I'll try my best to work with him.</b>

01:26:08.700 --> 01:26:10.490
<b>Mom, Dad...</b>

01:26:11.910 --> 01:26:15.000
<b>I finally became a hero.</b>

01:26:15.750 --> 01:26:20.710
<b>Someday, I will uncover the truth.</b>

01:26:22.800 --> 01:26:25.630
<b>I'm a little concerned
about my partner, though.</b>

01:26:44.440 --> 01:26:45.280
<b>Hello?</b>
